    ('8d12b7fd-9bcb-5709-bab6-d00e7e5327e6', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 1, 2430, 4900, 'Easy English Conversations.'),
    ('e1adb0fa-a2d5-5e49-9cde-85e6b7387bc4', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 2, 15820, 17470, 'I''m from Oxford!'),
    ('807049d4-b456-54c2-9328-11b14fbe99c2', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 3, 20059, 21940, 'Where is the train station?'),
    ('d640cb3e-4dae-5f61-ae49-7515703d1f29', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 4, 30070, 41030, 'Go past the school, Go past the school, and turn left.'),
    ('dbe81b4a-f513-52ac-8d19-39b698710369', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 5, 44830, 46547, 'Oh - no, no, no!'),
    ('e62d47ef-e3f4-53e9-8c40-0432ec5be110', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 6, 53540, 56300, 'It''s next to the pub.'),
    ('741338d9-892e-59ab-9bde-51ea13b05b9f', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 7, 63622, 65270, 'Where are you?'),
    ('96bffed5-e23c-55dd-a29d-d419e85d7eac', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 8, 65270, 69230, 'I''m in Petworth, but I''m lost.'),
    ('c194dd05-0e1a-5da1-bceb-c9f131f8f105', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 9, 69230, 72140, 'Where is the supermarket?'),
    ('88a16de8-164f-59ca-980f-54829545e913', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 10, 84190, 85710, 'Go past the school.'),
    ('550f7eb8-c25a-578b-a294-ac34a738b808', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 11, 85710, 89140, 'Go past the school.'),
    ('8656e6ca-a8e7-547f-aa5b-59e3ca69423a', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 12, 90550, 92190, 'It''s next to the park.'),
    ('c14da530-af8c-5d96-beb3-3e49a2d87b80', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 13, 92190, 95790, 'It''s next to the park.'),
    ('a504e9b8-73f0-5231-b053-e26731c63428', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 14, 95790, 97790, 'Oh, no. Sorry!'),
    ('797cd3d7-ed6e-5918-8761-73ffc1522673', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 15, 97790, 100070, 'It''s opposite the park.'),
    ('3c7d5644-dfbf-5563-9ddd-27c6c35970d9', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 16, 100070, 102180, 'It''s opposite the park.'),
    ('a3c836be-cc59-5435-ba5a-7e2afa1ffd04', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 17, 105750, 111910, 'Remember, you can improve your English at BBC Learning English dot com.'),
    ('744b2fa5-e753-568e-8491-630332cc9835', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 18, 111910, 113500, 'See you there soon.'),
    ('84217f7c-d464-5c04-8b74-3c31bc03b3f6', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 19, 116150, 117430, 'Where are you?'),
    ('035902ab-4899-5d8a-9d68-6c1e85d74b6c', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 20, 117430, 119950, 'I''m in Beijing, but I''m lost!'),
    ('5be92018-1511-5bcf-a6ec-d01f4b1b3cab', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 21, 119950, 121860, 'Where is the hospital?'),
    ('e8bad6ad-986d-52eb-98dd-d5cd95dee9ea', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 22, 124070, 131460, 'Go past the museum, Go past the museum, and turn left.'),
    ('d01b1522-fbee-5f1f-898c-314f9c9de57a', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 23, 139470, 142230, 'And it''s opposite the hotel.'),
    ('bf3c4747-1115-5606-95cd-6c0387506710', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 24, 142230, 144180, 'It''s opposite the hotel.'),
    ('a9342aaf-0789-513a-bd5d-eaf3b7e3cf9f', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 25, 149419, 152380, 'Where is the cinema?'),
    ('fa53361b-905d-501f-879c-0fed9828fa9e', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 26, 153070, 154590, 'Can you tell me?'),
    ('d72450fb-541d-54a6-b40a-ff53611a3ebc', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 27, 154590, 156460, 'Where is the cinema?'),
    ('f93bbd2c-8c0c-56ab-975c-7d9d6d913505', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 28, 170640, 176140, 'Go straight, and turn left.'),
    ('3ac5c681-7e57-5593-af33-b72f44f4adc2', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 29, 187870, 189700, 'Go past the park.'),
    ('a537f55f-31f5-590d-b34e-75c79b2d64f7', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 30, 199470, 202820, 'It''s next to the shop.'),
    ('1213bbec-c50b-50b7-83d8-3391ad8be87e', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 31, 207790, 210300, 'What is Tim doing?'),
    ('03a6830d-c3fa-5008-916d-28c9b372070f', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 32, 212510, 215339, 'Find out in the next video!'),
    ('db5598c5-e038-5e02-ae18-262fe909d94b', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 33, 215830, 218860, 'Where is the park in this photo?'),
    ('40adc3ce-5b06-5d72-acf2-51e7e6ae9b3f', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 34, 223390, 225550, 'Write a comment below.'),
    ('f12f4ca8-c017-5e46-81cd-855bafdf1eeb', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 35, 225550, 228939, 'And click here to subscribe to our channel.'),
    ('f4030d3f-765f-5736-9947-5c3695c4b110', 'SHXPpsIJTb0', 36, 229310, 231380, 'See you in the next video.'),
    ('f023be25-113e-5096-a5b5-c3e244e778d4', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 1, 34219, 36484, 'Now you have another choice.'),
    ('d0dec76e-515f-5642-b76d-5c87d1736aa2', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 2, 49019, 57204, 'If you''re like most people, you probably chose to take the guaranteed bonus in the first round and flip the coin in the second round.'),
    ('e069546f-adca-5965-8efc-e0b50e54ef98', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 3, 60213, 64155, 'The odds and outcomes in both rounds are exactly the same.'),
    ('653047c5-6342-519c-b7b0-75727d55ac27', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 4, 73314, 83005, 'Under rational economic theory, our decisions should follow a simple mathematical equation that weighs the level of risk against the amount at stake.'),
    ('0dbb3fac-4e2b-5f89-9a17-1a301bc37152', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 5, 83005, 85267, 'But studies have found that for many people,'),
    ('fdd9ec7d-fe3c-5615-a767-4df27531567d', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 6, 85267, 94922, 'the negative psychological impact we feel from losing something is about twice as strong as the positive impact of gaining the same thing.'),
    ('2d4e94ff-888d-55b0-a05c-af7f8ead1ac6', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 7, 94922, 106479, 'Loss aversion is one cognitive bias that arises from heuristics, problem-solving approaches based on previous experience and intuition rather than careful analysis.'),
    ('ba39206b-86a7-5d7b-b1ac-f856b4b82115', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 8, 106479, 113364, 'And these mental shortcuts can lead to irrational decisions, not like falling in love or bungee jumping off a cliff,'),
    ('8e8511e6-a44b-51af-ade5-6e66665e1a56', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 9, 113364, 117784, 'but logical fallacies that can easily be proven wrong.'),
    ('5410de03-48b6-5963-8e1b-e0cea1e9c3cd', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 10, 117784, 123541, 'Situations involving probability are notoriously bad for applying heuristics.'),
    ('d0f55565-87b1-58c0-9bd0-91879de43ef3', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 11, 123541, 130836, 'For instance, say you were to roll a die with four green faces and two red faces twenty times.'),
    ('a9ca4172-2116-5254-bb16-e334bdacc755', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 12, 136968, 139008, 'Which would you pick?'),
    ('6449be12-2b2c-568c-ac76-8c74108e0fa9', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 13, 149835, 151834, 'in other words, more likely.'),
    ('2a21f289-7fcf-5ad5-ac27-045d1dda49e5', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 14, 151834, 155082, 'This is what''s called a conjunction fallacy.'),
    ('38e039d3-4024-5c2c-a482-64edd1408697', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 15, 155082, 161557, 'Here, we expect to see more green rolls, so our brains can trick us into picking the less likely option.'),
    ('83aacc02-5290-5b41-8466-6aaa818b2b52', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 16, 161557, 165772, 'Heuristics are also terrible at dealing with numbers in general.'),
    ('b4896599-5ec9-5818-a19d-29458d0b45f8', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 17, 165772, 169492, 'In one example, students were split into two groups.'),
    ('13bee811-a7b6-562c-bff6-5a06348c8b8e', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 18, 180229, 187356, 'Both numbers were obviously way off, but when the students were then asked to guess the actual age at which he died,'),
    ('21f27a32-bf63-5adf-99ac-35468d65c5ef', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 19, 193486, 201696, 'Even though the clearly wrong information in the initial questions should have been irrelevant, it still affected the students'' estimates.'),
    ('5a388f20-0f67-53b8-9b48-2e7f758c3d5b', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 20, 201696, 211061, 'This is an example of the anchoring effect, and it''s often used in marketing and negotiations to raise the prices that people are willing to pay.'),
    ('bfe2e474-9d36-5ddb-aa82-a6fd028a89f8', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 21, 211061, 216948, 'So, if heuristics lead to all these wrong decisions, why do we even have them?'),
    ('d3358e71-0f9c-5d03-973a-6cd0d7cb761c', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 22, 216948, 219722, 'Well, because they can be quite effective.'),
    ('cd4a6914-46bf-50e6-a5bf-59de9fe889a8', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 23, 219722, 225674, 'For most of human history, survival depended on making quick decisions with limited information.'),
    ('2de58f23-26fc-5180-ae8e-4bace0e17b3a', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 24, 225674, 232725, 'When there''s no time to logically analyze all the possibilities, heuristics can sometimes save our lives.'),
    ('108264cb-4965-5cf5-9eca-3a2be597c1e7', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 25, 232725, 241130, 'But today''s environment requires far more complex decision-making, and these decisions are more biased by unconscious factors than we think,'),
    ('55101e4d-7881-53ee-970b-3c944b894686', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 26, 241130, 246122, 'affecting everything from health and education to finance and criminal justice.'),
    ('1bc17782-aad5-5c30-873a-18a35053bb64', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 27, 246122, 251137, 'We can''t just shut off our brain''s heuristics, but we can learn to be aware of them.'),
    ('8ce606ba-c681-5eff-9370-bde28f6ec620', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 28, 251137, 256673, 'When you come to a situation involving numbers, probability, or multiple details,'),
    ('84ef5cd0-53f3-588f-bc6d-c56665caaa65', 'V2EMuoM5IX4', 29, 256673, 263448, 'pause for a second and consider that the intuitive answer might not be the right one after all.'),
    ('66a2c16f-f857-5dba-88d9-c14d3295bf79', 'dbnch1goJr8', 1, 350, 2620, 'Hello my dear friends.'),
    ('35ea5e8d-4f81-5866-9c6d-1517cdd44165', 'dbnch1goJr8', 2, 11858, 18670, 'Today we are going to talk about something very close to my heart.'),
    ('083f83f2-a9f8-5477-8342-ceb917575ae7', 'dbnch1goJr8', 3, 18670, 20837, 'My family at home.'),
    ('696af2fc-dfed-544b-99ef-165ed6e6634b', 'dbnch1goJr8', 4, 31257, 38503, 'In this lesson, I will tell you about each person in my family.'),
    ('4a4e2af0-c354-54ae-b97f-22b36d19ed80', 'dbnch1goJr8', 5, 38503, 46379, 'I will share their names, what they do, and some little things about them.'),
    ('914369de-da1b-5fa5-b1a7-7422b4825dcd', 'dbnch1goJr8', 6, 46379, 52992, 'You will learn new words so you can talk about your own family, too.'),
    ('b52ec0cb-a1e1-5755-b7e5-53be0ef61b1f', 'dbnch1goJr8', 7, 52992, 60086, 'Don''t worry if you don''t understand everything the first time.'),
    ('5e18f7ab-c2d7-51b2-9408-164fb06b9b06', 'dbnch1goJr8', 8, 60086, 63966, 'I will speak slowly and clearly.'),
    ('50574698-48d8-5ae1-9152-b10edc58133f', 'dbnch1goJr8', 9, 63966, 72183, 'You can listen carefully and you can repeat the sentences after me.'),
    ('ecb76db7-1f27-5586-9324-7ef1d747c959', 'dbnch1goJr8', 10, 72183, 78042, 'Step by step your English will get better.'),
    ('78a09b94-5b3f-5296-9df6-7981ae1b39a9', 'dbnch1goJr8', 11, 78042, 86990, 'So take a deep breath, relax, and enjoy the story of my family.'),
    ('ee605c65-f4fa-5e64-83a0-7e797ec65f77', 'dbnch1goJr8', 12, 86990, 90457, 'Let''s begin together.'),
    ('e01d3c69-559d-591f-be75-3aec009467e4', 'dbnch1goJr8', 13, 90457, 94870, 'Let''s start with my mother.'),
    ('afae46f5-ae25-5f22-83f1-82be345b9202', 'dbnch1goJr8', 14, 113996, 122021, 'She loves cooking and she makes the best pasta in the world.'),
    ('330bba1b-0a50-53b4-b14f-9ec7e6b5b52d', 'dbnch1goJr8', 15, 122021, 131742, 'When I come home from school or work, she always asks, "How was your day?"'),
    ('ed8324c5-d987-52cc-a328-9aa611eed7ee', 'dbnch1goJr8', 16, 131742, 138958, 'She listens carefully to me and gives me good advice.'),
    ('1b274abf-1c82-5e28-83ae-40526b93f55b', 'dbnch1goJr8', 17, 138958, 147896, 'When I feel sad, she gives me a warm hug and helps me feel better.'),
    ('cd20ab72-ff90-5e1a-8f04-025f6809af19', 'dbnch1goJr8', 18, 147896, 153229, 'I am very lucky to have her in my life.'),
    ('c45c3496-9fb5-5fc5-a7f1-a7e1205a0061', 'dbnch1goJr8', 19, 153229, 159070, 'Now, let me tell you about my father.'),
    ('0a4c2d02-743e-58eb-8944-6916981b9ab8', 'dbnch1goJr8', 20, 159070, 162260, 'His name is David.'),
    ('45c85af5-df9c-58dc-838d-07192a4b6fc2', 'dbnch1goJr8', 21, 165310, 174781, 'My father works in an office, but at home he is our handyman.'),
    ('040eedfc-142b-5706-a928-f2ec7122dda3', 'dbnch1goJr8', 22, 174781, 184420, 'He can fix almost anything, the sink, the door, even my bicycle.'),
    ('93b4746c-629c-55ab-9a06-ee0a426c71c1', 'dbnch1goJr8', 23, 184910, 187826, 'He is also very funny.'),
    ('fb778fd1-bfca-5e0f-85cf-e077207d7311', 'dbnch1goJr8', 24, 187826, 198778, 'At the dinner table, he tells jokes that make everyone laugh until our stomachs hurt.'),
    ('c8d6838b-f095-5aff-a485-7c1a91cb49a3', 'dbnch1goJr8', 25, 198778, 208520, 'Sometimes on weekends, he takes us to the park or for a walk by the river.'),
    ('734147c1-4659-5e45-bf6e-5bbdf1458908', 'dbnch1goJr8', 26, 208520, 214563, 'He likes spending time with the family.'),
    ('61d4ecd8-9fe8-5210-8090-2f12ebfdcd71', 'dbnch1goJr8', 27, 214563, 218228, 'I also have a brother.'),
    ('e2c1b84c-d6a2-51d1-b0a0-d7bc1f689edd', 'dbnch1goJr8', 28, 224190, 232247, 'Tom is in high school and he plays football every weekend.'),
    ('df6b23ba-39f2-58ba-bcec-5a4b2ee0f4ad', 'dbnch1goJr8', 29, 232247, 240482, 'He is very good at it and sometimes his team wins trophies.'),
    ('f9c8711e-1620-50ea-8477-06229760cf1b', 'dbnch1goJr8', 30, 240482, 250323, 'Tom can be a little noisy when he plays video games, but I don''t mind.'),
    ('88ade623-e4c9-53e5-b6f5-29b9211055af', 'dbnch1goJr8', 31, 250323, 256482, 'Sometimes we play together and we laugh a lot.'),
    ('38e1e26e-c921-55be-a1ec-3c5064230b11', 'dbnch1goJr8', 32, 256482, 263963, 'Even though he is younger than me, he is very protective.'),
    ('b34a3eb9-6046-55be-b50f-e0b14919fc8a', 'dbnch1goJr8', 33, 263963, 271030, 'If I have a problem, he is always ready to help.'),
    ('3371c831-630c-5cfb-b1b2-1e7eaee29a90', 'dbnch1goJr8', 34, 271030, 276262, 'And this is my little sister Anna.'),
    ('2b142b48-976c-5b22-ba8b-7c4e7a41a812', 'dbnch1goJr8', 35, 279061, 283731, 'She is small, but she is very clever.'),
    ('8d671b0d-ad51-58de-a573-de052f6c192b', 'dbnch1goJr8', 36, 283731, 292698, 'She loves reading story books, especially about princesses and adventures.'),
    ('de203554-8dd8-5735-a407-2bff992b37b1', 'dbnch1goJr8', 37, 292698, 299780, 'She also loves to draw, and her pictures are very beautiful.'),
    ('61319b37-cac7-5bfe-bdea-5ddf05d49524', 'dbnch1goJr8', 38, 300590, 308206, 'Sometimes she draws our family sitting together in the living room.'),
    ('62fb5237-0361-5993-96e2-48619bf8cb1a', 'dbnch1goJr8', 39, 308206, 316240, 'She asks many questions because she wants to learn about the world.'),
    ('350b8a16-b4fa-5c74-bdf1-68d21ce79a3e', 'dbnch1goJr8', 40, 316240, 322051, 'Even though she is young, she has a big heart.'),
    ('6e63b9aa-369c-5a18-a04b-226a51f6b1a3', 'dbnch1goJr8', 41, 322051, 331060, 'She often makes small gifts for us like handmade cards or paper flowers.'),
    ('5b38c4f5-f322-5d94-a17a-8475ecdc0a4f', 'dbnch1goJr8', 42, 331060, 339524, 'Each person in my family is different, but that''s what makes us special.'),
    ('f24bfc15-efa1-5fce-8e9a-1819a566d349', 'dbnch1goJr8', 43, 339524, 344145, 'We love and care for each other very much.'),
    ('f8314b9d-da81-587b-b406-6f45fe313ab9', 'dbnch1goJr8', 44, 344145, 350543, 'When we are together, our home feels warm and happy.'),
    ('d7169e41-0e4b-5e72-a330-51e3b4fb45b3', 'dbnch1goJr8', 45, 350543, 357308, 'Now, let me tell you what life is like in our home.'),
    ('d3d07db8-4093-52aa-addd-f8428d16f2ae', 'dbnch1goJr8', 46, 357308, 363079, 'In the evening, we all come together for dinner.'),
    ('302fa156-6deb-5d03-b0e6-144761ff951b', 'dbnch1goJr8', 47, 363079, 370873, 'My mother cooks delicious food and we sit at the table as a family.'),
    ('ad0b9d3d-fb6d-5ea0-9022-44f890fc07e2', 'dbnch1goJr8', 48, 370873, 380226, 'We talk about our day, what happened at school, at work, or with friends.'),
    ('2a247582-eb05-59aa-a4e9-fad60c19ef15', 'dbnch1goJr8', 49, 380226, 387981, 'Sometimes we laugh so much that we forget to finish our food.'),
    ('937ffdcd-05a1-55a2-a47e-b7b416248e1c', 'dbnch1goJr8', 50, 387981, 393470, 'On weekends we like to spend time together.'),
    ('3d32c140-b0cf-5f05-8d3b-25246aac8a96', 'dbnch1goJr8', 51, 393470, 398839, 'Sometimes we watch movies in the living room.'),
    ('974d4eb9-78fa-54ba-af31-419cfe21eb5f', 'dbnch1goJr8', 52, 398839, 405718, 'We make popcorn, turn off the lights, and enjoy the film.'),
    ('ac9aebfa-9b0b-58a3-aceb-529dd7d389ea', 'dbnch1goJr8', 53, 405718, 410163, 'Other times we play board games.'),
    ('b9beb6b2-ba10-5bcc-8f2b-55030dd07290', 'dbnch1goJr8', 54, 410163, 421121, 'Tom usually wins and Anna pretends to be upset, but we all know she is having fun.'),
    ('d264775d-fed1-5d10-869a-9c30354c6b19', 'dbnch1goJr8', 55, 421121, 426141, 'We also like to go outside as a family.'),
    ('bf224b60-c687-5c2f-a214-59313200cc26', 'dbnch1goJr8', 56, 426141, 431651, 'In the spring, we go for walks in the park.'),
    ('67608f9c-66fa-5822-bbfd-22557153c714', 'dbnch1goJr8', 57, 431651, 436968, 'In the summer, we sometimes have a picnic.'),
    ('c1e389cf-0868-5cbe-aff8-6e0c6fdd1f55', 'dbnch1goJr8', 58, 436968, 441790, 'We bring sandwiches, fruit, and juice.'),
    ('115b4f21-b2b1-5b20-aa07-bc432d690140', 'dbnch1goJr8', 59, 441790, 445524, 'And we sit under a big tree.'),
    ('de0c0b75-c17d-5ccd-ba2a-8411082c4714', 'dbnch1goJr8', 60, 445524, 450537, 'We eat, talk, and enjoy the sunshine.'),
    ('41db7247-7631-5b88-a919-4a2b4537a317', 'dbnch1goJr8', 61, 450537, 458106, 'Even when we are busy, we try to make time for each other.'),
    ('527e92a5-b871-5653-8ba4-2f4423274287', 'dbnch1goJr8', 62, 458106, 463706, 'Our home is full of love, laughter, and care.'),
    ('475bc8ef-7ffc-5ddd-9d4c-cf4845d08453', 'dbnch1goJr8', 63, 463706, 469780, 'When we are together, we feel happy and safe.'),
    ('a2881ba0-a004-5d97-ba72-e58b52806391', 'dbnch1goJr8', 64, 469780, 476563, 'That is what makes our family life so special.'),
    ('774cab19-322a-5a0b-afd6-fb84baae82ec', 'dbnch1goJr8', 65, 476563, 482365, 'Now, I want to tell you about our home.'),
    ('fcd7cdc8-3bb7-5181-9668-16d30df799d9', 'dbnch1goJr8', 66, 482365, 491471, 'It is not very big, but it is warm, bright, and comfortable.'),
    ('5374c7c1-8460-5a20-9496-ad00b4f96701', 'dbnch1goJr8', 67, 491471, 501371, 'When you walk inside, you can feel the love and care in every room.'),
    ('dfef986f-46ac-501b-bdda-9c2137ffaaed', 'dbnch1goJr8', 68, 501371, 509940, 'It is the place where we share our best memories together.'),
    ('1f8e6de4-ced5-5863-b7b2-410ad1a051ab', 'dbnch1goJr8', 69, 510830, 520756, 'When you enter our home, the first room you see is the living room.'),
    ('fb1541e0-b427-5641-ba02-4d35f62696cf', 'dbnch1goJr8', 70, 520756, 529399, 'It has a big soft sofa where we sit together in the evenings.'),
    ('4396985c-b76a-55ff-b4ad-d6d48fcbcf7c', 'dbnch1goJr8', 71, 529399, 542945, 'There is a coffee table in the middle and on the table you can often find a vase with fresh flowers.'),
    ('ac305542-687a-5f9a-965b-8b74015a46c9', 'dbnch1goJr8', 72, 542945, 555402, 'A large window lets in the sunshine during the day, making the room feel bright and happy.'),
    ('07bf6395-6189-5967-b9c8-6f2c24d3604e', 'dbnch1goJr8', 73, 555402, 569556, 'On the wall there are family photos, pictures of birthdays, holidays, and fun times we have shared.'),
    ('1479c64f-f9d8-51e7-b088-d8b112847c48', 'dbnch1goJr8', 74, 569556, 575323, 'Next to the living room is our kitchen.'),
    ('1338654e-a954-5329-a3f8-7b1bb639f676', 'dbnch1goJr8', 75, 575323, 581356, 'It is small but full of delicious smells.'),
    ('c2ba6643-aac2-5ccd-b12c-33ce3ba80d42', 'dbnch1goJr8', 76, 581356, 588093, 'This is where my mother cooks her tasty meals.'),
    ('36dcb1b7-90fc-510a-9121-d47d1a151f64', 'dbnch1goJr8', 77, 588093, 599123, 'There is a round table in the corner where we sometimes have breakfast together.'),
    ('dfdd6f17-4558-5994-b50c-006f6c8037c6', 'dbnch1goJr8', 78, 599123, 607481, 'The shelves are full of cups, plates, and jars with spices.'),
    ('02ac28ec-07ad-555b-8583-5a4f6c641fbf', 'dbnch1goJr8', 79, 607481, 616307, 'When I am in the kitchen, I always feel a sense of warmth.'),
    ('215db828-de83-542e-bf10-1f267d6317f9', 'dbnch1goJr8', 80, 616307, 620836, 'Our home has three bedrooms.'),
    ('000334d4-c7b0-527a-9418-795dc71841c8', 'dbnch1goJr8', 81, 620836, 625725, 'My parents have one bedroom.'),
    ('b5dc1eb5-d825-5aea-9947-d0baeb5c5e3b', 'dbnch1goJr8', 82, 625725, 630446, 'It is simple but very tidy.'),
    ('e868ac49-4430-5227-80f2-23bf5b86009b', 'dbnch1goJr8', 83, 630446, 636944, 'There is a big bed with a soft blanket.'),
    ('4518be9d-5d8b-5bf9-aeeb-4b4bfa794872', 'dbnch1goJr8', 84, 636944, 647213, 'And on the bedside table is a small lamp that gives a gentle light.'),
    ('e8153758-16cf-5739-b55a-89cfa925fdb2', 'dbnch1goJr8', 85, 647213, 650535, 'Tom has his own room.'),
    ('50a30bd8-f73a-5c00-a55b-646a2c1d6474', 'dbnch1goJr8', 86, 650535, 660791, 'His room is full of football posters and trophies from his matches.'),
    ('f794b87e-e692-5e2d-927e-84e436cdb086', 'dbnch1goJr8', 87, 660791, 674875, 'There is a desk where he does his homework, but sometimes it is also covered with his football magazines.'),
    ('78067785-c788-5a64-b33e-39929080504a', 'dbnch1goJr8', 88, 674875, 678488, 'Anna also has her own room.'),
    ('85421121-6a0a-5299-ab8a-6385a256f877', 'dbnch1goJr8', 89, 678488, 688900, 'Her room is colorful with drawings on the wall and toys neatly on the shelves.'),
    ('a6d5ba34-53e3-5470-ba0d-ca634f39a9c4', 'dbnch1goJr8', 90, 689390, 695590, 'She has a small desk for reading and drawing.'),
    ('dc9a4de7-408c-589a-9b29-bfea7556e8a3', 'dbnch1goJr8', 91, 695590, 703230, 'Sometimes she invites me in to see her newest picture.'),
    ('601a2214-dcba-5e3c-bad4-02113fbbbb3c', 'dbnch1goJr8', 92, 703230, 707550, 'And then there is my room.'),
    ('eb116586-e606-5d62-b733-499507837b37', 'dbnch1goJr8', 93, 707550, 712030, 'It is small, but I love it.'),
    ('b5387c27-1333-52b9-ad7b-39763508e5dd', 'dbnch1goJr8', 94, 712030, 725518, 'I have a comfortable bed, a desk for studying, and a bookshelf full of my favorite books.'),
    ('c779f0ef-4d1a-526a-8304-5ce394154c67', 'dbnch1goJr8', 95, 725518, 731134, 'Next to my bed, there is a small lamp.'),
    ('79169fec-d326-54d2-a697-1120673a65f9', 'dbnch1goJr8', 96, 731134, 738819, 'And at night, I like to read before going to sleep.'),
    ('f337dd45-91cb-51d9-96ae-b528a8d26e41', 'dbnch1goJr8', 97, 738819, 744151, 'We have one bathroom for all of us.'),
    ('31d0dcc2-0704-5c48-a74b-11f8dde99578', 'dbnch1goJr8', 98, 744151, 757550, 'In the mornings, we take turns so everyone can get ready for school or work on time.'),
    ('b877dbaa-7c6f-5985-a19b-a1788b90cfb0', 'dbnch1goJr8', 99, 757550, 765706, 'Sometimes it feels busy, but we always make it work.'),
    ('d296ed02-4d93-54ec-9fab-1c641352fd8a', 'dbnch1goJr8', 100, 765706, 777679, 'Our home may not be big or fancy, but it is filled with love, laughter, and care.'),
    ('dbf74f21-da4f-5b69-ba05-e0a6b8c1267b', 'dbnch1goJr8', 101, 777679, 793517, 'It is the place where we feel safe, where we can relax after a long day, and where we make special memories together.'),
    ('11ed5e0a-6dda-5ddd-9c98-ed2887b41dc2', 'dbnch1goJr8', 102, 793517, 797717, 'Our home is not just a building.'),
    ('7b47792f-a3e4-5837-81cb-08dc82e04eb3', 'dbnch1goJr8', 103, 797717, 802368, 'It is the heart of our family.'),
    ('e0b6a73d-1dd0-57b9-b92a-6957e24d96b7', 'dbnch1goJr8', 104, 802368, 812342, 'So my dear friends, now you know about my family and my home.'),
    ('5066a853-e160-54a7-b064-613b04783631', 'dbnch1goJr8', 105, 812342, 823044, 'They are the people I love the most and the place where I feel safe and happy.'),
    ('ab11d1f6-78bb-5d22-9b6e-eddec337119e', 'dbnch1goJr8', 106, 823044, 833181, 'Our home may not be big, but it is full of laughter, kindness, and love.'),
    ('51e340e6-6576-587c-8cf5-5664ec332632', 'dbnch1goJr8', 107, 833181, 837592, 'Now, I want to hear about you.'),
    ('43668782-ac35-58e9-8109-4e719fcaa908', 'dbnch1goJr8', 108, 837592, 842103, 'Can you tell me about your family?'),
    ('26573849-3b9b-5616-b842-9f7545997679', 'dbnch1goJr8', 109, 842103, 844689, 'Who do you live with?'),
    ('f4b679dd-abb1-5042-8949-3d552015973a', 'dbnch1goJr8', 110, 844689, 847510, 'What is your home like?'),
    ('89249735-fbd8-5712-af94-400745ef5860', 'dbnch1goJr8', 111, 847510, 851540, 'What do you like to do together?'),
    ('b2235b17-9f0f-55be-8b4d-785136aa9892', 'dbnch1goJr8', 112, 852510, 860005, 'You can use the sentences and words from today''s lesson to help you.'),
    ('372b6439-d0d1-5ac2-9237-a24151fb9054', 'dbnch1goJr8', 113, 860005, 865769, 'For example, you can say, "This is my mother.'),
    ('6a2f64e9-cdc8-5fb7-9c17-b7292139aed9', 'dbnch1goJr8', 114, 865769, 868562, 'She is very kind."'),
    ('b31dc37c-6c0d-577f-8b2f-24b141d63288', 'dbnch1goJr8', 115, 868562, 877242, 'Or, "My family likes to eat dinner together in the evening."'),
    ('505e73c6-e2d0-5e4f-97d3-f96dc17437ca', 'dbnch1goJr8', 116, 877242, 882559, 'Remember, it''s okay if you make mistakes.'),
    ('0d172d13-037d-5d53-a129-2608e947fa7a', 'dbnch1goJr8', 117, 882559, 886483, 'Mistakes are part of learning.'),
    ('19c72a8e-07a3-5fe6-88a8-d0f16e0f652f', 'dbnch1goJr8', 118, 886483, 891339, 'The most important thing is to try.'),
    ('bc693e42-b0ce-5785-a890-f0371efaa06f', 'dbnch1goJr8', 119, 891339, 896503, 'Step by step, your English will grow.'),
    ('04ef4352-565d-5e05-af26-48b73db90c23', 'dbnch1goJr8', 120, 896503, 909087, 'If you can write a few sentences about your family in a notebook or say them out loud to a friend.'),
    ('194fe13f-b086-58b9-8a87-d41e85569771', 'dbnch1goJr8', 121, 909087, 916330, 'The more you practice, the more confident you will feel.'),
    ('2f6e4b4c-279f-5a3f-9350-e76915cc8092', 'dbnch1goJr8', 122, 916330, 918649, 'I believe in you.'),
    ('01871b13-5b45-5e9f-a4a4-747ca2555930', 'dbnch1goJr8', 123, 918649, 931675, 'Your family, your home, and your story are special, and the world would love to hear them in your English voice.'),
    ('e8df6ab0-d51f-5fda-823f-8a082358f727', 'dbnch1goJr8', 124, 931675, 936193, 'Thank you for spending time with me today.'),
    ('54a55fcb-cc9c-57f4-9ad5-9d72269e7275', 'dbnch1goJr8', 125, 936193, 943859, 'I''m proud of you for learning, and I hope you are proud of yourself, too.'),
    ('4a642e0b-691f-594d-828c-e9687c2aa321', 'dbnch1goJr8', 126, 944430, 954100, 'Until next time, keep smiling, keep practicing, and keep sharing your beautiful stories.'),
    ('2d61752f-764d-5220-a46a-1eba03a0d071', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 1, 41520, 49207, 'I''m not pretending this is an exhaustive list, but these seven, I think, are pretty large habits that we can all fall into.'),
    ('004ae23d-7c70-54e0-b27a-ebd6399e4cbf', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 2, 51939, 54196, 'Speaking ill of somebody who''s not present.'),
    ('c8e6e5e0-06a0-50c0-9c23-92b61727e2b4', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 3, 54650, 60799, 'Not a nice habit, and we know perfectly well the person gossiping, five minutes later, will be gossiping about us.'),
    ('fe02e2ad-c035-5cc0-bf9e-f9b346b1c61b', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 4, 63465, 65873, 'We know people who are like this in conversation,'),
    ('64f6144c-a20b-5b27-9baa-8a3379445ab7', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 5, 65873, 72105, 'and it''s very hard to listen to somebody if you know that you''re being judged and found wanting at the same time.'),
    ('065e63f7-5d4d-5f9f-9116-19207c73ee9e', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 6, 74397, 75709, 'You can fall into this.'),
    ('4ea67bb0-d6ae-5079-b6ea-b304f353f874', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 7, 75709, 80241, 'My mother, in the last years of her life, became very negative, and it''s hard to listen.'),
    ('d75a7648-c0c0-5d4f-9417-0388ed5cb8a3', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 8, 87212, 89711, 'It''s hard to listen when somebody''s that negative.'),
    ('a8ec995d-fb74-59dd-a97f-9fbeb693236f', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 9, 90881, 93425, 'And another form of negativity, complaining.'),
    ('3a3d7516-6943-5f9e-a1e5-3b2ac1e221cc', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 10, 93425, 97492, 'Well, this is the national art of the U.K.'),
    ('51690adc-646f-595d-853d-4686e7ef4bb5', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 11, 97492, 98927, 'It''s our national sport.'),
    ('b2b80370-9830-5c1c-b763-545194807c52', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 12, 98927, 104505, 'We complain about the weather, sport, about politics, about everything, but actually, complaining is viral misery.'),
    ('ad58d3ea-a252-54b1-ba53-697965802597', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 13, 104505, 107287, 'It''s not spreading sunshine and lightness in the world.'),
    ('a5526ef1-1fc3-5059-8cc0-3ec11bf0aff3', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 14, 109998, 111346, 'We''ve all met this guy.'),
    ('6ce45195-9d35-52ee-896c-fd4efc6c0ae7', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 15, 111346, 112946, 'Maybe we''ve all been this guy.'),
    ('33e0ecc4-ef14-5852-80d5-85c5b1ae1d6e', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 16, 112946, 115440, 'Some people have a blamethrower.'),
    ('36774947-1585-52f6-8138-e8e6694ed465', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 17, 115440, 120512, 'They just pass it on to everybody else and don''t take responsibility for their actions, and again,'),
    ('7a34f8b0-b83f-5d6b-bafe-f51248ddfb34', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 18, 120512, 122932, 'hard to listen to somebody who is being like that.'),
    ('85d4c965-cf3c-5406-87f4-c57107dbc89f', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 19, 122932, 128160, 'Penultimate, the sixth of the seven, embroidery, exaggeration.'),
    ('4b16064b-4bc7-508e-ac27-add50295f40a', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 20, 128160, 130588, 'It demeans our language, actually, sometimes.'),
    ('93442655-4119-5c18-a285-56966018968b', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 21, 130588, 135296, 'For example, if I see something that really is awesome, what do I call it?'),
    ('58463968-85b8-586d-ac73-615f85de0fde', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 22, 137790, 144273, 'And then, of course, this exaggeration becomes lying, and we don''t want to listen to people we know are lying to us.'),
    ('d82845f0-f9aa-5bbc-b9eb-1f670c5388ad', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 23, 144273, 146663, 'And finally, dogmatism.'),
    ('c882fc74-ce87-5805-8d5a-f6d839ad2a55', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 24, 147638, 151273, 'The confusion of facts with opinions.'),
    ('41664efe-9b8e-506f-a943-906698a5ba74', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 25, 151273, 154713, 'When those two things get conflated, you''re listening into the wind.'),
    ('43308374-b50c-5d25-91ad-effbed64409d', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 26, 154713, 158404, 'You know, somebody is bombarding you with their opinions as if they were true.'),
    ('131e01b4-116a-5a83-97e6-1863880ae30a', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 27, 158404, 160497, 'It''s difficult to listen to that.'),
    ('c513468b-6f9c-59e1-b5ff-6d504f32b179', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 28, 160497, 163538, 'So here they are, seven deadly sins of speaking.'),
    ('48aaef9c-94df-548e-a94d-817f6ffa6274', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 29, 163538, 165971, 'These are things I think we need to avoid.'),
    ('5ee62ff9-7628-5b71-8c32-3c87e3e6c6c1', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 30, 165971, 168840, 'But is there a positive way to think about this?'),
    ('20ae6949-2f8a-5c52-9a14-3dfb12c8b4ee', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 31, 168840, 170249, 'Yes, there is.'),
    ('4d88dd74-9728-5a0d-b2c0-936ce353dedb', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 32, 170408, 175924, 'I''d like to suggest that there are four really powerful cornerstones, foundations,'),
    ('f82c2ec9-e777-53d7-84f4-37760f20f36a', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 33, 175924, 181731, 'that we can stand on if we want our speech to be powerful and to make change in the world.'),
    ('3cd18d8e-578a-5a6e-8f43-5f9a982a2547', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 34, 182238, 184473, 'Fortunately, these things spell a word.'),
    ('083eb725-c668-5fcd-a20e-2e9d703cfa17', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 35, 184473, 187569, 'The word is "hail," and it has a great definition as well.'),
    ('801f7820-811e-5aeb-9446-60c80bb6fd2c', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 36, 187569, 191525, 'I''m not talking about the stuff that falls from the sky and hits you on the head.'),
    ('6821b619-afdc-5d52-adbc-b7e88d7a6e1a', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 37, 191525, 194990, 'I''m talking about this definition, to greet or acclaim enthusiastically,'),
    ('eec307cf-69f6-5f4a-abe0-144b9f8a8f2e', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 38, 194990, 198853, 'which is how I think our words will be received if we stand on these four things.'),
    ('a3953509-bc77-518d-84a0-a7793542f5a5', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 39, 198853, 200375, 'So what do they stand for?'),
    ('a78e6701-767b-51b5-9a75-5e1d62c1415b', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 40, 200375, 201901, 'See if you can guess.'),
    ('1358fe94-80db-5083-ba24-24adbbf50281', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 41, 202270, 208204, 'The H, honesty, of course, being true in what you say, being straight and clear.'),
    ('776dc292-358c-5cfb-980a-815d0ce80a96', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 42, 208204, 212245, 'The A is authenticity, just being yourself.'),
    ('5a4642a2-8ab6-51ac-b316-f0005ee0602e', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 43, 212245, 217393, 'A friend of mine described it as standing in your own truth, which I think is a lovely way to put it.'),
    ('7929a9b2-89e4-5526-88ab-3aafa7dcf45e', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 44, 217393, 223797, 'The I is integrity, being your word, actually doing what you say, and being somebody people can trust.'),
    ('8ee04951-08de-5328-bfa7-09dff45e87fa', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 45, 224308, 226454, 'And the L is love.'),
    ('ab150ed4-3d31-5cb2-a3ff-66fb04ec2338', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 46, 227080, 232610, 'I don''t mean romantic love, but I do mean wishing people well, for two reasons.'),
    ('a44fee94-7c10-58f7-a34e-574ff314c326', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 47, 232610, 236024, 'First of all, I think absolute honesty may not be what we want.'),
    ('81f61703-60b8-5053-a151-d0145893a6a6', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 48, 236024, 238613, 'I mean, my goodness, you look ugly this morning.'),
    ('55a307cc-cd6b-5527-91c8-17a8b7ba4e9e', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 49, 238613, 241971, 'Perhaps that''s not necessary.'),
    ('985eb391-521e-57f0-88fc-8f98fc3f7844', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 50, 241971, 245329, 'Tempered with love, of course, honesty is a great thing.'),
    ('c6d1cadc-2250-5e74-a30a-614d2398bbb4', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 51, 245329, 251061, 'But also, if you''re really wishing somebody well, it''s very hard to judge them at the same time.'),
    ('e9360fa7-3725-56c9-b8b4-001a83ff5f99', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 52, 251061, 254773, 'I''m not even sure you can do those two things simultaneously.'),
    ('ff67a1d1-71a9-5d61-9268-2371f45cf6fc', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 53, 256860, 262588, 'Also, now that''s what you say, and it''s like the old song, it is what you say, it''s also the way that you say it.'),
    ('80867154-f4ec-5f7a-bfbc-a756b5ca25f6', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 54, 262588, 264360, 'You have an amazing toolbox.'),
    ('93f4c016-2298-5e2c-bd93-2089a9ac9625', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 55, 264360, 269760, 'This instrument is incredible, and yet this is a toolbox that very few people have ever opened.'),
    ('e1b5c24d-d497-52ff-9f7d-74f36d06a00d', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 56, 269760, 276068, 'I''d like to have a little rummage in there with you now and just pull a few tools out that you might like to take away and play with,'),
    ('6d56429e-6082-526f-a363-c8dfb4505682', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 57, 276068, 278392, 'which will increase the power of your speaking.'),
    ('0464f869-cc59-5958-8139-c60c7e54c846', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 58, 278392, 279936, 'Register, for example.'),
    ('f46ff01a-15e4-59d3-a323-d8189e1058b9', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 59, 279936, 286184, 'Now, falsetto register may not be very useful most of the time, but there''s a register in between.'),
    ('7195f547-02c4-582f-80a8-998bed1e25fb', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 60, 286184, 290155, 'I''m not going to get very technical about this for any of you who are voice coaches.'),
    ('b746b378-30a7-5c5d-9f05-c28d03390102', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 61, 290155, 291892, 'You can locate your voice, however.'),
    ('7955fb78-467c-5727-85b2-36c486828be1', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 62, 291892, 294774, 'So if I talk up here in my nose, you can hear the difference.'),
    ('47db6ee1-8546-5eb9-b9b6-cdd204308528', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 63, 294774, 298935, 'If I go down here in my throat, which is where most of us speak from most of the time.'),
    ('888be734-8b66-5ae5-82a1-91dee98c3dd0', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 64, 298935, 303070, 'But if you want weight, you need to go down here to the chest.'),
    ('76d96ae8-6226-5c85-9e0f-f792e47cc0e5', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 65, 303070, 304680, 'You hear the difference?'),
    ('787e93a5-253f-53f4-bc9c-a8bedc7afec1', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 66, 304680, 313600, 'We vote for politicians with lower voices, it''s true, because we associate depth with power and with authority.'),
    ('fc58cf1d-e8d0-579c-b40c-9d3faed39ace', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 67, 316084, 317451, 'Then we have timbre.'),
    ('c4f2c066-d9ce-598e-b58a-f1dfc5ced6a1', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 68, 317451, 319220, 'It''s the way your voice feels.'),
    ('3f80bad8-9a75-5cf2-817b-2da2a38fa88f', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 69, 319220, 326010, 'Again, the research shows that we prefer voices which are rich, smooth, warm, like hot chocolate.'),
    ('38935d74-e814-5116-8354-2bc92739ca72', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 70, 326585, 331315, 'Well if that''s not you, that''s not the end of the world, because you can train.'),
    ('cb94c0ab-6547-50d5-b63d-81d04958b6f7', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 71, 331315, 332559, 'Go and get a voice coach.'),
    ('51d221d6-d25b-5587-a7f1-0d0627ad6cfc', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 72, 332559, 339511, 'And there are amazing things you can do with breathing, with posture, and with exercises to improve the timbre of your voice.'),
    ('5592e591-2061-507d-ac22-7ffb13fe1818', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 73, 340210, 341177, 'I love prosody.'),
    ('10cd7c7b-984c-54ec-a8c4-1ad620895c64', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 74, 341177, 345427, 'This is the sing-song, the meta-language that we use in order to impart meaning.'),
    ('ac9f1eba-bf78-5633-a55d-8e42dfe73f72', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 75, 345427, 348265, 'It''s root one for meaning in conversation.'),
    ('47583c23-bf43-512c-8b02-419fae99e1a2', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 76, 348265, 354561, 'People who speak all on one note are really quite hard to listen to if they don''t have any prosody at all.'),
    ('377e9983-c5a6-5e13-a569-8821a774b762', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 77, 354561, 359623, 'That''s where the word "monotonic" comes from, or monotonous, monotone.'),
    ('2a1559f0-df0d-5576-af19-363d7ec7719d', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 78, 360256, 367908, 'Also, we have repetitive prosody now coming in, where every sentence ends as if it were a question when it''s actually not a question,'),
    ('7f5c9fe6-822d-59c1-8b82-41ef40c47d49', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 79, 367908, 368899, 'it''s a statement?'),
    ('c01f3028-7408-5137-b07d-ea20677a7af4', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 80, 371104, 377944, 'And if you repeat that one, it''s actually restricting your ability to communicate through prosody, which I think is a shame,'),
    ('a2e67f89-32f6-553d-a253-99f1198bae7d', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 81, 377944, 380079, 'so let''s try and break that habit.'),
    ('31660003-a989-5697-8a5a-339b3f62998e', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 82, 382368, 390570, 'I can get very excited by saying something really quickly, or I can slow right down to emphasize, and at the end of that, of course,'),
    ('f1250c75-84f8-53ab-ae35-b53fcacd0934', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 83, 390570, 392294, 'is our old friend silence.'),
    ('31862aea-bd15-5e01-95b9-9ada9aa26531', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 84, 394505, 397794, 'There''s nothing wrong with a bit of silence in a talk, is there?'),
    ('3cb1ee1a-6615-53b0-a226-e491aecd12eb', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 85, 398511, 401100, 'We don''t have to fill it with ums and ahs.'),
    ('c3d2615e-0ce2-5eb3-bf60-d8e6b1291693', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 86, 401783, 403162, 'It can be very powerful.'),
    ('e0bc9914-d736-5c0c-b98d-6e58696d6e91', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 87, 403773, 408745, 'Of course, pitch often goes along with pace to indicate arousal, but you can do it just with pitch.'),
    ('765b6031-1662-5da7-a2a5-4e3ef27b2dc8', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 88, 408745, 410333, 'Where did you leave my keys?'),
    ('0ae66f59-786d-57d4-ae4c-c2a4fe33a15c', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 89, 410333, 412437, 'Where did you leave my keys?'),
    ('874078ca-a349-53d7-8bab-336450667c37', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 90, 412437, 416106, 'So, slightly different meaning in those two deliveries.'),
    ('6450f3d5-99dd-5eb9-ab2b-53ed2fec12fd', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 91, 416106, 418352, 'And finally, volume.'),
    ('005ba11e-6d42-5766-8059-33d796c58822', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 92, 418352, 421753, 'I can get really excited by using volume.'),
    ('a84d15df-4f76-5e07-96cb-83a4ea06acfb', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 93, 421753, 423930, 'Sorry about that, if I startled anybody.'),
    ('58d97c91-1de3-574e-b064-867661aa6e65', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 94, 423930, 427603, 'Or, I can have you really pay attention by getting very quiet.'),
