    ('b47a90ef-b9c5-52bb-b896-3c5cc245aa86', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 96, 430477, 431975, 'Try not to do that.'),
    ('675fc4de-75d5-516e-bc3f-3ca03058f785', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 97, 441065, 446149, 'Of course, where this all comes into play most of all is when you''ve got something really important to do.'),
    ('162018a2-28f2-5446-9480-3a9c2ed79789', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 98, 446149, 449601, 'It might be standing on a stage like this and giving a talk to people.'),
    ('597f477d-c7d8-5865-85ed-c05732e3a21e', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 99, 449601, 454643, 'It might be proposing marriage, asking for a raise, a wedding speech.'),
    ('4629f807-f29c-560b-9d6b-ad7fd3350b00', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 100, 454643, 462459, 'Whatever it is, if it''s really important, you owe it to yourself to look at this toolbox and the engine that it''s going to work on,'),
    ('3c6e9ba7-7bd2-5ff9-a4a3-1bad11d287b5', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 101, 462459, 465554, 'and no engine works well without being warmed up.'),
    ('66407ec1-fe1a-5e98-9ee7-cddbd9d65387', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 102, 465554, 467173, 'Warm up your voice.'),
    ('779c348f-3536-5d01-bfe3-628084f5a276', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 103, 467432, 469507, 'Actually, let me show you how to do that.'),
    ('17b8dcd3-7da5-5843-bae3-b336b4a24ec0', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 104, 469507, 472486, 'Would you all like to stand up for a moment?'),
    ('079ad21e-e292-5acd-88ba-29116324a6ec', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 105, 472486, 478875, 'I''m going to show you the six vocal warm-up exercises that I do before every talk I ever do.'),
    ('7c759015-d402-5dfd-8429-dc24e7de2627', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 106, 478875, 481935, 'Any time you''re going to talk to anybody important, do these.'),
    ('679a516f-4a1c-53ff-bee6-be5cb6fe9a27', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 107, 487714, 489468, 'One more time.'),
    ('cd7cdbd6-0662-517f-9c9c-f6807f5c2c6c', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 108, 492340, 498319, 'Now we''re going to warm up our lips, and we''re going to go Ba, Ba, Ba, Ba, Ba, Ba, Ba, Ba.'),
    ('a4dc0f92-0d65-56ca-8a7a-9fb857e33f2e', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 109, 504749, 506803, 'Now your lips should be coming alive.'),
    ('3eafd844-35aa-5a2b-a42f-7a912e27afb9', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 110, 506803, 512925, 'We''re going to do the tongue next with exaggerated la, la, la, la, la, la, la, la, la.'),
    ('33bdf1ab-bb8b-5e5c-a3b2-4f72fb70796a', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 111, 513312, 515015, 'You''re getting really good at this.'),
    ('195c9f7b-27ee-5ff7-9cd4-663c966d3f11', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 112, 515015, 517171, 'And then, roll an R.'),
    ('271eb447-8341-5683-b51f-ef09f94a523e', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 113, 517905, 520121, 'That''s like champagne for the tongue.'),
    ('0bb424b4-6687-57b0-b0e4-c4b2c8f733fa', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 114, 520121, 524248, 'Finally, and if I can only do one, the pros call this the siren.'),
    ('a8ced55a-2ee6-5cfe-a05b-ab54a89f725f', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 115, 525090, 526892, 'It starts with "we" and goes to "aw."'),
    ('022acf90-cb72-58d2-9ff5-f06b4e580f1b', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 116, 526892, 528661, 'The "we" is high, the "aw" is low.'),
    ('63413188-0312-5475-875b-cf36ed1cce4c', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 117, 535169, 536919, 'Give yourselves a round of applause.'),
    ('bcc0e80a-7493-51b6-a2aa-be06a3f1257d', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 118, 536919, 538314, 'Take a seat, thank you.'),
    ('b46c8f17-acda-53ae-86ee-d23b65ab4aab', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 119, 539662, 542286, 'Next time you speak, do those in advance.'),
    ('e765b141-33c6-565c-9adb-ed61824cf7a2', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 120, 542286, 544926, 'Now let me just put this in context to close.'),
    ('6dea4de0-edb2-5420-94ef-8e4f80990f44', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 121, 544926, 547222, 'This is a serious point here.'),
    ('95c95121-8d5f-57df-a346-7b8d3635cafb', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 122, 547222, 549053, 'This is where we are now, right?'),
    ('878ce2b0-a05b-55f4-99e0-b7c3c33b56b1', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 123, 549053, 555505, 'We speak not very well to people who simply aren''t listening in an environment that''s all about noise and bad acoustics.'),
    ('8de36e4a-564d-59e4-a525-ca870170b85e', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 124, 555505, 558748, 'I have talked about that on this stage in different phases.'),
    ('f2c5584c-30e5-55a1-8d65-1b9e17c4d5bd', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 125, 558748, 567552, 'What would the world be like if we were speaking powerfully to people who were listening consciously in environments which were actually fit for purpose?'),
    ('dc24e00a-0505-5d6b-afdd-ac26410aa2bf', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 126, 567552, 570535, 'Or to make that a bit larger,'),
    ('b12c508e-1e1c-5089-acd3-7cb27b9e3300', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 127, 570535, 579497, 'what would the world be like if we were creating sound consciously and consuming sound consciously and designing all our environments consciously for sound?'),
    ('37c0af4c-57c6-5370-a122-8016f3bde9bc', 'eIho2S0ZahI', 128, 579497, 589331, 'That would be a world that does sound beautiful, and one where understanding would be the norm, and that is an idea worth spreading.'),
    ('e856da13-d310-57f9-9f5a-98041e2b07ba', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 1, 21336, 24665, 'I was two years older than my sister at the time -- I mean,'),
    ('834aa558-e9e6-5216-94d8-b6f9ea7925bf', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 2, 24665, 29865, 'I''m two years older than her now -- but at the time it meant she had to do everything that I wanted to do,'),
    ('4d7c43dd-6827-5dbc-b1e3-9bccf6fe23c1', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 3, 29865, 31210, 'and I wanted to play war.'),
    ('74f2dbb5-98c1-5551-8ddb-ca7e3fd2e3d0', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 4, 36760, 38043, 'Joe soldiers and weaponry.'),
    ('396ca451-0741-585c-94ce-df9bf1664e4a', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 5, 42550, 48053, 'There are differing accounts of what actually happened that afternoon, but since my sister is not here with us today,'),
    ('caa22874-29f6-5461-ac53-1922c3bd1c9a', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 6, 48053, 53669, 'let me tell you the true story -- which is my sister''s a little on the clumsy side.'),
    ('4cc3f0b6-5012-5c64-9a41-2063bf702eb3', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 7, 53669, 56715, 'Somehow, without any help or push from her older brother at all,'),
    ('b2f546ae-1667-55d3-8a0f-2902eb953582', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 8, 56715, 61289, 'Amy disappeared off of the top of the bunk bed and landed with this crash on the floor.'),
    ('7f3ebd32-3da8-5509-8848-5eafd6c737cc', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 9, 76336, 91143, 'And seeing as how I had accidentally broken Amy''s arm just one week before -- heroically pushing her out of the way of an oncoming imaginary sniper bullet,'),
    ('3effb056-22d8-5e01-b376-c1de23664dd0', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 10, 93076, 95146, 'for which I have yet to be thanked,'),
    ('9c91dc1d-4e0a-5556-b5c2-412e6b89fa26', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 11, 95146, 101168, 'I was trying as hard as I could -- she didn''t even see it coming -- I was trying hard to be on my best behavior.'),
    ('3d2cf7e5-adfc-518c-bf84-c6cecd037f85', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 12, 101168, 102542, 'And I saw my sister''s face,'),
    ('20c5b171-b79a-576d-823b-df3d9c2b3760', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 13, 102542, 110130, 'this wail of pain and suffering and surprise threatening to erupt from her mouth and wake my parents from the long winter''s nap for which they had settled.'),
    ('d4945d0a-4962-5fa1-bd87-3db4e920156c', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 14, 117784, 118733, 'I said, "Amy, wait.'),
    ('77eb6379-fb4c-5596-a62e-7d0a5b3c5033', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 15, 119091, 120410, 'Did you see how you landed?'),
    ('4449f9f5-1b77-564d-aaec-09a4d4f7a02a', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 16, 129603, 135554, 'Now, that was cheating, because there was nothing she would want more than not to be Amy the hurt five year-old little sister,'),
    ('8af3b8d7-a4a3-51a8-aff2-f79f67ce2d04', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 17, 135554, 137010, 'but Amy the special unicorn.'),
    ('8bd5a583-8049-523a-926e-3afec58c0241', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 18, 137010, 140366, 'Of course, this option was open to her brain at no point in the past.'),
    ('5aaf66f0-1fac-5c50-8a7f-3f2361830cb9', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 19, 140366, 143487, 'And you could see how my poor, manipulated sister faced conflict,'),
    ('82dd1255-21a4-5ca4-b88e-3a05a7465573', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 20, 143487, 149211, 'as her little brain attempted to devote resources to feeling the pain and suffering and surprise she just experienced,'),
    ('bd40ecd2-7cf4-5749-88be-1c1f1ce91165', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 21, 149211, 151780, 'or contemplating her new-found identity as a unicorn.'),
    ('90f1c0c3-501a-53ef-b709-61fe9aefc330', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 22, 151780, 152910, 'And the latter won.'),
    ('2deac83d-d738-5e83-9160-b531eac7d5b1', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 23, 152910, 158541, 'Instead of crying or ceasing our play, instead of waking my parents, with all the negative consequences for me,'),
    ('5ceab307-ae07-5939-ab77-440db4a5b65e', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 24, 158541, 168328, 'a smile spread across her face and she scrambled back up onto the bunk bed with all the grace of a baby unicorn -- with one broken leg.'),
    ('61dedfe5-83a2-52d8-9c44-f118a810bae4', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 25, 180232, 186952, 'We had stumbled across something called positive psychology, which is the reason I''m here today and the reason that I wake up every morning.'),
    ('4846a5ed-2900-5b02-9588-ddf5f3f0967b', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 26, 186952, 191310, 'When I started talking about this research outside of academia, with companies and schools,'),
    ('108b414d-a9f9-53a8-837f-4cb227a9c665', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 27, 191310, 194410, 'the first thing they said to never do is to start with a graph.'),
    ('5c1f834b-32f5-5089-b138-7e50dabe0609', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 28, 194410, 196888, 'The first thing I want to do is start with a graph.'),
    ('fc8ad34b-816b-5cb8-9d06-cdac97c49534', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 29, 196888, 201185, 'This graph looks boring, but it is the reason I get excited and wake up every morning.'),
    ('bd1636b1-52e1-55a0-a42d-d0233354acd7', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 30, 201185, 203974, 'And this graph doesn''t even mean anything; it''s fake data.'),
    ('f6d0e31e-ffb6-51e2-ac24-024891d977f6', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 31, 203974, 213210, 'What we found is -- If I got this data studying you, I would be thrilled, because there''s a trend there,'),
    ('1bda8d8e-5962-5d39-a835-dc37310be1be', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 32, 213210, 217210, 'and that means that I can get published, which is all that really matters.'),
    ('dd0588e3-1204-5efb-ba82-98ba43bdc2c3', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 33, 217210, 223310, 'There is one weird red dot above the curve, there''s one weirdo in the room -- I know who you are,'),
    ('2cf6cd44-19d2-5dc8-9d2c-84d142f86953', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 34, 223310, 226210, 'I saw you earlier -- that''s no problem.'),
    ('56268898-0a38-54f5-92b6-db62707fd894', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 35, 226210, 230210, 'That''s no problem, as most of you know, because I can just delete that dot.'),
    ('07227ea9-2453-57ca-a5bf-7f31904715a5', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 36, 230210, 233338, 'I can delete that dot because that''s clearly a measurement error.'),
    ('2acedfa5-264d-5339-8f2e-69911c1f1b69', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 37, 233338, 236854, 'And we know that''s a measurement error because it''s messing up my data.'),
    ('3e1efd96-57ba-51fc-aa74-361d83def334', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 38, 237791, 244613, 'So one of the first things we teach people in economics, statistics, business and psychology courses is how, in a statistically valid way,'),
    ('57748f9d-7f59-5daa-8056-f002a9087c79', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 39, 244613, 246007, 'do we eliminate the weirdos.'),
    ('1c1ea4ec-6582-5aea-a51b-bf0e3a23e649', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 40, 246007, 249410, 'How do we eliminate the outliers so we can find the line of best fit?'),
    ('e99a8a7d-c578-5f45-a06f-16729a1d9379', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 41, 249410, 254310, 'Which is fantastic if I''m trying to find out how many Advil the average person should be taking -- two.'),
    ('964b58b4-e73a-511a-a3c2-505cd62c2753', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 42, 254310, 262805, 'But if I''m interested in your potential, or for happiness or productivity or energy or creativity, we''re creating the cult of the average with science.'),
    ('86dd8d07-141c-5523-9131-f6eac9e1a64b', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 43, 262805, 266931, 'If I asked a question like, "How fast can a child learn how to read in a classroom?"'),
    ('53ae9546-8f0b-5c40-9ebd-49e2be1a1e38', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 44, 266931, 271803, 'scientists change the answer to "How fast does the average child learn how to read in that classroom?"'),
    ('950340f8-ae14-55fb-8a20-e9ede1d98980', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 45, 271803, 273973, 'and we tailor the class towards the average.'),
    ('fc40674d-b651-5e40-bc79-56b72b2008bb', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 46, 273973, 281210, 'If you fall below the average, then psychologists get thrilled, because that means you''re depressed or have a disorder, or hopefully both.'),
    ('121602c5-4d15-5a48-adec-26f7e8daaead', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 47, 281210, 286210, 'We''re hoping for both because our business model is, if you come into a therapy session with one problem,'),
    ('0961b7b2-4b70-5ef5-9461-3e6cb10f63d5', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 48, 286210, 289910, 'we want to make sure you leave knowing you have ten, so you keep coming back.'),
    ('d226c0ce-b153-5759-a66f-d0c7f62c3fbf', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 49, 289910, 294449, 'We''ll go back into your childhood if necessary, but eventually we want to make you normal again.'),
    ('2cf1281c-315f-5847-80cf-9333867eaa52', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 50, 294449, 295910, 'But normal is merely average.'),
    ('f2f8be23-b233-52b2-a62e-d86149230a07', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 51, 295910, 301638, 'And positive psychology posits that if we study what is merely average, we will remain merely average.'),
    ('b4d4dd94-f7e5-59cf-a3d7-cea68faeccc7', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 52, 301638, 308062, 'Then instead of deleting those positive outliers, what I intentionally do is come into a population like this one and say, why?'),
    ('22c81dd2-92c6-51e2-816f-9ee83338a5d5', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 53, 308062, 315788, 'Why are some of you high above the curve in terms of intellectual, athletic, musical ability, creativity, energy levels, resiliency in the face of challenge,'),
    ('1dfdd989-1708-504c-bcec-a080d976fe76', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 54, 316410, 319977, 'Whatever it is, instead of deleting you, what I want to do is study you.'),
    ('8933aeb1-65d5-5cb8-82bf-793373c46800', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 55, 319977, 324088, 'Because maybe we can glean information, not just how to move people up to the average,'),
    ('06c16460-6c7a-5608-ae22-dac453b8a5cc', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 56, 324088, 327510, 'but move the entire average up in our companies and schools worldwide.'),
    ('a56e5409-db64-58e4-9b7b-27d8f3f7c34f', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 57, 327510, 332610, 'The reason this graph is important to me is, on the news, the majority of the information is not positive.'),
    ('61d4d212-de2f-521c-be56-d29c18b8d31b', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 58, 332610, 333710, 'in fact it''s negative.'),
    ('88569f09-0a3a-578a-9f73-168d4a64c39e', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 59, 333710, 336910, 'Most of it''s about murder, corruption, diseases, natural disasters.'),
    ('ceee44f6-9866-55d4-ba19-bb1349ea7a1f', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 60, 336910, 342029, 'And very quickly, my brain starts to think that''s the accurate ratio of negative to positive in the world.'),
    ('91d7c707-87ef-5c23-aa13-c9818760a0cc', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 61, 342029, 344257, 'This creates "the medical school syndrome."'),
    ('53739fc8-7970-5110-b098-87aa066a0196', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 62, 344257, 350249, 'During the first year of medical training, as you read through a list of all the symptoms and diseases,'),
    ('f8b9ae2b-7cb3-5bf4-89d9-a93f6f93b23d', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 63, 350249, 352629, 'suddenly you realize you have all of them.'),
    ('a75953b9-133d-582e-8d43-ae17b0750cfe', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 64, 353529, 356625, 'I have a brother in-law named Bobo, which is a whole other story.'),
    ('b75d032a-8300-5547-ad64-55477276b396', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 65, 356625, 358211, 'Bobo married Amy the unicorn.'),
    ('fb5af1fe-9ee5-5bb1-b746-f35a9cac4ed8', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 66, 358211, 366641, 'Bobo called me on the phone -- from Yale Medical School, and Bobo said, "Shawn, I have leprosy."'),
    ('c75a621a-71cd-531c-85b9-203429eac165', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 67, 368210, 370821, 'Which, even at Yale, is extraordinarily rare.'),
    ('f4762b55-3ad2-5d93-8676-027d4a0dcc23', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 68, 370821, 376218, 'But I had no idea how to console poor Bobo because he had just gotten over an entire week of menopause.'),
    ('64b8d92d-deb3-5449-b8d9-60e3296ce26e', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 69, 377210, 384010, 'We''re finding it''s not necessarily the reality that shapes us, but the lens through which your brain views the world that shapes your reality.'),
    ('457b2ed2-baf2-5feb-b020-f7f886200cb9', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 70, 384010, 387311, 'And if we can change the lens, not only can we change your happiness,'),
    ('6767a5c4-0ca1-5e44-a4dd-3602aa9512d3', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 71, 387311, 390983, 'we can change every single educational and business outcome at the same time.'),
    ('ee167312-d1a8-547a-a55f-f4aa066c681e', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 72, 390983, 392510, 'I applied to Harvard on a dare.'),
    ('88be6356-1236-5eb3-aa4e-7d0aa147b83f', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 73, 392510, 395710, 'I didn''t expect to get in, and my family had no money for college.'),
    ('425866a3-a8fc-503f-a1e6-aa39d320cd56', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 74, 395710, 398910, 'When I got a military scholarship two weeks later, they let me go.'),
    ('77f17e5f-cbb3-5d57-a9dc-2970f1f5601f', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 75, 398910, 401710, 'Something that wasn''t even a possibility became a reality.'),
    ('ef647e93-83e1-532a-bf84-f31e3628740d', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 76, 401710, 406410, 'I assumed everyone there would see it as a privilege as well, that they''d be excited to be there.'),
    ('3c0593c5-24a1-526a-94dc-5b29458de31c', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 77, 406410, 411410, 'Even in a classroom full of people smarter than you, I felt you''d be happy just to be in that classroom.'),
    ('997cd914-ece3-587f-8676-f51012ff31ab', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 78, 411410, 414110, 'But what I found is, while some people experience that,'),
    ('624c1432-e8ac-5f16-9c8a-6847cc8c34c8', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 79, 414110, 420497, 'when I graduated after my four years and then spent the next eight years living in the dorms with the students -- Harvard asked me to;'),
    ('6a65644c-8d42-5f8b-88b1-c31cc56341dd', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 80, 420497, 421540, 'I wasn''t that guy.'),
    ('84046cf2-6407-517b-91cf-5edcb0e484cc', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 81, 423210, 426610, 'I was an officer to counsel students through the difficult four years.'),
    ('40c77c43-1468-599e-8bc5-e3bb0ed1b0e7', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 82, 426610, 429765, 'And in my research and my teaching, I found that these students,'),
    ('406a055c-b974-55eb-bb97-4a67cb4cc831', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 83, 429765, 435939, 'no matter how happy they were with their original success of getting into the school, two weeks later their brains were focused,'),
    ('6a8abbac-b226-5141-8f43-46e4e980b145', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 84, 435939, 442910, 'not on the privilege of being there, nor on their philosophy or physics, but on the competition, the workload, the hassles, stresses, complaints.'),
    ('a1e5d154-3244-5b2a-a5f0-32a9ca7f2bee', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 85, 442910, 448173, 'When I first went in there, I walked into the freshmen dining hall, which is where my friends from Waco, Texas,'),
    ('2e36e137-6c8d-5c3c-b67d-42adfb71f09d', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 86, 448173, 451010, 'which is where I grew up -- I know some of you know this.'),
    ('2fade236-1348-59b0-a7c8-56a14a512dd6', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 87, 451010, 456110, 'When they''d visit, they''d look around, and say, "This dining hall looks like something out of Hogwart''s."'),
    ('7491c6df-c793-5010-9770-383305301c29', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 88, 456110, 458710, 'It does, because that was Hogwart''s and that''s Harvard.'),
    ('e5a6b355-e2fe-52dd-b676-b8d3ac4a198d', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 89, 458710, 463210, 'And when they see this, they say, "Why do you waste your time studying happiness at Harvard?'),
    ('720edec4-50f9-5476-af54-d82d192bab52', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 90, 463210, 466310, 'What does a Harvard student possibly have to be unhappy about?"'),
    ('80837cc3-fcd6-5e2a-bd47-40214b8c02e8', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 91, 466310, 470410, 'Embedded within that question is the key to understanding the science of happiness.'),
    ('6f835719-326c-570a-a881-21f6333cdb58', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 92, 470410, 476160, 'Because what that question assumes is that our external world is predictive of our happiness levels, when in reality,'),
    ('2d69f848-f719-5158-98b5-5202339d672c', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 93, 486825, 493335, 'And if we change it, if we change our formula for happiness and success, we can change the way that we can then affect reality.'),
    ('0a86a58c-290e-5b4e-b3dc-ff0be3a1a85d', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 94, 501177, 505510, 'your social support and your ability to see stress as a challenge instead of as a threat.'),
    ('d06eb839-d985-52e1-a6ac-ab189b383bb0', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 95, 505510, 511010, 'I talked to a New England boarding school, probably the most prestigious one, and they said, "We already know that.'),
    ('2eecbe4b-ff46-5da2-81c6-860969ba4841', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 96, 511010, 514710, 'So every year, instead of just teaching our students, we have a wellness week.'),
    ('e048ac27-26e0-55de-a68e-f7f5b42bb41f', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 97, 514710, 515739, 'And we''re so excited.'),
    ('70b4d097-83c7-552f-bc0b-26f12127f96d', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 98, 515739, 519910, 'Monday night we have the world''s leading expert will speak about adolescent depression.'),
    ('fe57f478-e0d2-5301-9c1e-cb99c63f4d8b', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 99, 519910, 522173, 'Tuesday night it''s school violence and bullying.'),
    ('20450be0-3f77-5a9c-8a67-3e12466a968a', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 100, 522173, 524010, 'Wednesday night is eating disorders.'),
    ('600cc066-680a-5e10-b034-8befa8e08a26', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 101, 524010, 525710, 'Thursday night is illicit drug use.'),
    ('aeb0e816-7ff4-589d-80d5-8035883c66c6', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 102, 525710, 529289, 'And Friday night we''re trying to decide between risky sex or happiness."'),
    ('1eae93ac-a848-5a59-8734-9473ff2acec8', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 103, 530210, 532503, 'I said, "That''s most people''s Friday nights."'),
    ('0e7df02d-ac7b-5045-8217-478b520c05d7', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 104, 538210, 541092, 'Which I''m glad you liked, but they did not like that at all.'),
    ('d0e4681d-8d34-5e5b-bece-cf7255052231', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 105, 541092, 542210, 'Silence on the phone.'),
    ('98d83c8b-81a1-59f5-b8fd-4729fb25d18b', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 106, 542210, 548210, 'And into the silence, I said, "I''d be happy to speak at your school, but that''s not a wellness week, that''s a sickness week.'),
    ('d7dad206-f715-51e4-a93e-23e59e9fa1cb', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 107, 548210, 552610, 'You''ve outlined all the negative things that can happen, but not talked about the positive."'),
    ('75a6e20f-c55a-5f36-8caf-4a91d6bf2ad5', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 108, 552610, 554410, 'The absence of disease is not health.'),
    ('ab25ba3a-8c32-5ecc-a26f-4deb312ce16c', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 109, 554410, 558736, 'Here''s how we get to health: We need to reverse the formula for happiness and success.'),
    ('268e346c-8cd3-5150-a471-868d75b5c867', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 110, 564810, 571106, 'And I found that most companies and schools follow a formula for success, which is this: If I work harder, I''ll be more successful.'),
    ('297df8bd-d149-5b51-96cd-d14e6ed955ea', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 111, 571106, 573510, 'And if I''m more successful, then I''ll be happier.'),
    ('524d36e4-7e52-5b58-8f2a-2e3fe4c6147b', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 112, 573510, 578210, 'That undergirds most of our parenting and managing styles, the way that we motivate our behavior.'),
    ('5ca6af8d-6a54-5ad4-906d-bdb54c2433eb', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 113, 578210, 581854, 'And the problem is it''s scientifically broken and backwards for two reasons.'),
    ('5c029d6f-541e-5a6f-9e79-25c125270260', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 114, 581854, 586410, 'Every time your brain has a success, you just changed the goalpost of what success looked like.'),
    ('f2b98a80-3980-5099-a1ca-f19fbfa740f5', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 115, 586410, 592106, 'You got good grades, now you have to get better grades, you got into a good school and after you get into a better one,'),
    ('b081268c-e65c-5645-8938-be4b6eba7126', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 116, 592106, 597208, 'you got a good job, now you have to get a better job, you hit your sales target, we''re going to change it.'),
    ('516ec2dc-64e2-5c07-9487-1a7a4dbd4157', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 117, 597208, 601109, 'And if happiness is on the opposite side of success, your brain never gets there.'),
    ('cb4e6c6e-88ff-51da-bec4-ea9302329a6d', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 118, 601109, 604210, 'We''ve pushed happiness over the cognitive horizon, as a society.'),
    ('e1bf3e85-658b-5279-a5b2-0688e3310a3b', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 119, 604210, 607906, 'And that''s because we think we have to be successful, then we''ll be happier.'),
    ('6db9e703-30fd-55cf-ae9b-d15f4f039bf6', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 120, 607906, 610005, 'But our brains work in the opposite order.'),
    ('3df9be20-69d4-55a6-a990-3ad5dc67515e', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 121, 610005, 616270, 'If you can raise somebody''s level of positivity in the present, then their brain experiences what we now call a happiness advantage,'),
    ('7d2e7c09-c810-5afa-8eb7-b8d2974e28c1', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 122, 616270, 621100, 'which is your brain at positive performs significantly better than at negative, neutral or stressed.'),
    ('37b6914a-6945-5888-880b-a6d7816ec9b1', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 123, 621100, 624554, 'Your intelligence rises, your creativity rises, your energy levels rise.'),
    ('1b86d029-8aa2-52ef-b48a-8b6001f85c73', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 124, 624554, 627875, 'In fact, we''ve found that every single business outcome improves.'),
    ('fc843d56-0eb9-57a2-bf29-b38d810341a6', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 125, 640410, 642310, 'Which means we can reverse the formula.'),
    ('4eb87c4d-d597-5fe3-bf38-c4287f03bdde', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 126, 642310, 648610, 'If we can find a way of becoming positive in the present, then our brains work even more successfully as we''re able to work harder,'),
    ('c47c9309-bf8f-5a8d-aec4-ccee20f2f3f3', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 127, 648610, 650110, 'faster and more intelligently.'),
    ('e13daf8f-a8d8-542a-ac33-adecf5fe17b8', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 128, 650110, 655210, 'We need to be able to reverse this formula so we can start to see what our brains are actually capable of.'),
    ('f9d84cd5-9426-5e7f-a683-8f81de6be70e', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 129, 655210, 659598, 'Because dopamine, which floods into your system when you''re positive, has two functions.'),
    ('f2efa471-c849-59d6-8d2c-8447abd371b6', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 130, 659598, 661599, 'Not only does it make you happier,'),
    ('923b66d9-1eb4-5cac-b69d-fe7809e8e4a3', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 131, 661599, 666801, 'it turns on all of the learning centers in your brain allowing you to adapt to the world in a different way.'),
    ('8e3be3f2-297f-5b55-a81c-9883a404cbb0', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 132, 666801, 671329, 'We''ve found there are ways that you can train your brain to be able to become more positive.'),
    ('2f970dd3-a603-51ef-bb71-54ea276326df', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 133, 675898, 679799, 'allowing your brain to actually work more optimistically and more successfully.'),
    ('b76549b9-6c6f-5289-935e-137fd392900f', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 134, 679799, 683827, 'We''ve done these things in research now in every company that I''ve worked with,'),
    ('59f9cc2a-820e-5f08-bb21-ca28758a3f23', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 135, 689313, 696031, 'And at the end of that, their brain starts to retain a pattern of scanning the world not for the negative, but for the positive first.'),
    ('79df89bf-cd4f-5413-a011-7d59b1a039ac', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 136, 701090, 703897, 'Exercise teaches your brain that your behavior matters.'),
    ('52e4760d-7c85-5426-a385-7ebe9f92fbac', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 137, 712775, 716076, 'And finally, random acts of kindness are conscious acts of kindness.'),
    ('dc003887-1418-50c0-b137-99da86558ff9', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 138, 716076, 722279, 'We get people, when they open up their inbox, to write one positive email praising or thanking somebody in their support network.'),
    ('40f18e04-328a-57de-9b42-cd9cce201113', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 139, 722279, 726481, 'And by doing these activities and by training your brain just like we train our bodies,'),
    ('f674803e-5ec0-583b-b939-a13c855752fa', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 140, 726481, 732709, 'what we''ve found is we can reverse the formula for happiness and success, and in doing so, not only create ripples of positivity,'),
    ('23ca7cdc-2ad5-53fe-937a-164fd1a4d877', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 141, 732709, 733810, 'but a real revolution.'),
    ('63645c03-f773-5115-8d77-47a582774b8f', 'fLJsdqxnZb0', 142, 733810, 735036, 'Thank you very much.'),
    ('183b64d2-70b1-5fb1-bcf9-0091d82cb30e', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 1, 23421, 29954, 'Well, you can drink another cup of coffee and spend the next few hours cramming and practicing, but believe it or not,'),
    ('a78f3e88-7ea5-5ff1-8e31-b658d021ee06', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 2, 29954, 35767, 'you might be better off closing the books, putting away the music, and going to sleep.'),
    ('1e46da1e-1096-50fc-b499-ea7f3cc43692', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 3, 52429, 58707, 'Instead, it''s a critical function, during which your body balances and regulates its vital systems,'),
    ('38645b0f-2b10-55e1-a183-e815d86b9cf1', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 4, 58707, 65385, 'affecting respiration and regulating everything from circulation to growth and immune response.'),
    ('2f1543fa-406e-51d5-9e67-ffa9fedee9b0', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 5, 72536, 75423, 'It turns out that sleep is also crucial for your brain,'),
    ('0269f93d-081a-5347-850a-5491093b2e23', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 6, 75423, 80803, 'with a fifth of your body''s circulatory blood being channeled to it as you drift off.'),
    ('80a3c87c-5637-5062-b760-2d6288c4f043', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 7, 80803, 89309, 'And what goes on in your brain while you sleep is an intensely active period of restructuring that''s crucial for how our memory works.'),
    ('220ee6ff-fe08-51cb-bd0d-45c58e1a7d27', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 8, 89309, 94355, 'At first glance, our ability to remember things doesn''t seem very impressive at all.'),
    ('8ac72963-c1f8-5e60-bfbe-960517259ac9', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 9, 107084, 110685, 'But this loss can be prevented through memory consolidation,'),
    ('d70025cc-a4ee-53f9-9319-1e4c9d1c9931', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 10, 110685, 118853, 'the process by which information is moved from our fleeting short-term memory to our more durable long-term memory.'),
    ('1cfd993d-4934-5112-b373-e085ca607f35', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 11, 118853, 125440, 'This consolidation occurs with the help of a major part of the brain, known as the hippocampus.'),
    ('e4e30ed2-9905-5cd0-a6d5-29ebbbb5a4a7', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 12, 152244, 162012, 'What this case revealed, among other things, was that the hippocampus was specifically involved in the consolidation of long-term declarative memory,'),
    ('8755aac7-b37d-5c18-8db9-45cf40bfa2e3', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 13, 162012, 167075, 'such as the facts and concepts you need to remember for that test, rather than procedural memory,'),
    ('27947fa3-8e4c-5ebd-a7f8-83a76954acd6', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 14, 167075, 171828, 'such as the finger movements you need to master for that recital.'),
    ('84b4dbf2-757a-51e4-87ce-b6e854ec1ee6', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 15, 180696, 187021, 'Sensory data is initially transcribed and temporarily recorded in the neurons as short-term memory.'),
    ('7a15847d-dc52-5b20-affc-b20de7d45df3', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 16, 187021, 193100, 'From there, it travels to the hippocampus, which strengthens and enhances the neurons in that cortical area.'),
    ('f1ee442f-01fe-561a-9e49-c85c57b7d63b', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 17, 193100, 200291, 'Thanks to the phenomenon of neuroplasticity, new synaptic buds are formed, allowing new connections between neurons,'),
    ('2ad48568-215e-5a20-af3d-42ad7e7b66e3', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 18, 200291, 205884, 'and strengthening the neural network where the information will be returned as long-term memory.'),
    ('c799e622-25b8-5b14-81d2-015c207a06b8', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 19, 205884, 208751, 'So why do we remember some things and not others?'),
    ('2403a218-1c55-5f34-8173-d454a389f54c', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 20, 208751, 214250, 'Well, there are a few ways to influence the extent and effectiveness of memory retention.'),
    ('8728627a-a766-5337-8c15-4fcc529d54fc', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 21, 214250, 224677, 'For example, memories that are formed in times of heightened feeling, or even stress, will be better recorded due to the hippocampus'' link with emotion.'),
    ('1f6bc465-c352-5dad-843b-d3cbc0f08460', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 22, 224677, 231828, 'But one of the major factors contributing to memory consolidation is, you guessed it, a good night''s sleep.'),
    ('71c463f6-6178-5379-9a59-009854a1e0ee', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 23, 231828, 239178, 'Sleep is composed of four stages, the deepest of which are known as slow-wave sleep and rapid eye movement.'),
    ('ececa85c-3d54-578e-b98e-769bc82b4f93', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 24, 239178, 249636, 'EEG machines monitoring people during these stages have shown electrical impulses moving between the brainstem, hippocampus, thalamus, and cortex,'),
    ('90779687-8f36-5fa1-81ae-801d73274dfd', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 25, 249636, 253478, 'which serve as relay stations of memory formation.'),
    ('06ee2e75-f2aa-54ae-b678-941e0db102f6', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 26, 253478, 259058, 'And the different stages of sleep have been shown to help consolidate different types of memories.'),
    ('b5b09392-01e3-5820-bc8e-856abf00d3ff', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 27, 259058, 268902, 'During the non-REM slow-wave sleep, declarative memory is encoded into a temporary store in the anterior part of the hippocampus.'),
    ('1f290387-1140-5845-a8a1-e3f46edecab9', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 28, 268902, 280948, 'Through a continuing dialogue between the cortex and hippocampus, it is then repeatedly reactivated, driving its gradual redistribution to long-term storage in the cortex.'),
    ('53b36ec5-396a-54d1-ac3c-75b10bf56ed2', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 29, 280948, 288424, 'REM sleep, on the other hand, with its similarity to waking brain activity, is associated with the consolidation of procedural memory.'),
    ('58d5e6bf-9ff1-5f5a-a26b-96390c9d9429', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 30, 288424, 298465, 'So based on the studies, going to sleep three hours after memorizing your formulas and one hour after practicing your scales would be the most ideal.'),
    ('d56a6a6d-b274-5140-942b-4248523e6ce6', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 31, 298465, 303242, 'So hopefully you can see now that skimping on sleep not only harms your long-term health,'),
    ('d1807a56-b249-557d-afff-9b0a3f9e277c', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 32, 303242, 309370, 'but actually makes it less likely that you''ll retain all that knowledge and practice from the previous night,'),
    ('80b4459f-c49c-5baf-abe5-5630e4c1a779', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 33, 309370, 313493, 'all of which just goes to affirm the wisdom of the phrase, "Sleep on it."'),
    ('e06da969-09dd-5982-94f3-44da78a23141', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 34, 313493, 319316, 'When you think about all the internal restructuring and forming of new connections that occurs while you slumber,'),
    ('b65a695c-5687-592a-9b43-52be043d64f9', 'gedoSfZvBgE', 35, 319316, 327687, 'you could even say that proper sleep will have you waking up every morning with a new and improved brain, ready to face the challenges ahead.'),
    ('6a765610-3ebe-576d-88e4-9bc5531c95a9', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 1, 0, 6550, 'And now let''s turn to a young woman who has chosen to lend her voice to this very important solidarity movement.'),
    ('3471d597-e4ae-5663-a931-94ecd548f8a9', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 2, 6550, 11172, 'She''s a leading British actor, an advocate for gender equality in her own right.'),
    ('e6ac6bcf-e9f1-56e5-a528-93e9b86f1d0e', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 3, 11172, 15510, 'She''s been involved with a promotion of girl''s education for several years.'),
    ('bf160530-1faf-51e8-bcf8-689c5d1cb9aa', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 4, 15510, 21210, 'As part of her humanitarian efforts she has visited Bangladesh, Zambia.'),
    ('6ea88b98-c6b7-5c8d-b376-65b23ce7c760', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 5, 21210, 27550, 'Recently returned as we just heard from Uruguay on her first mission with UN women.'),
    ('955a8306-0376-56d4-a0b3-63f0a3f32679', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 6, 27550, 35419, 'Ladies and Gentlemen, please join me in welcoming to this stage our co-host and the UN Women''s Global Goodwill Ambassador Emma Watson.'),
    ('336a460f-1436-50be-95cb-fd0548d58c40', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 7, 111570, 123220, 'And the more I''ve spoken about feminism, the more I have realized that fighting for women''s rights has too often become synonymous with man hating.'),
    ('fc3e63aa-9431-533c-b01d-eca1701f2f69', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 8, 134490, 144659, 'For the record, feminism by definition is the belief that men and women should have equal rights and opportunities.'),
    ('560761fe-2a16-50b4-93ee-f7b4cfca3c42', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 9, 145570, 152519, 'It is the theory of political, economic, and social equality of the sexes.'),
    ('535c8d3f-aaeb-5ac3-8a61-635caa53bb07', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 10, 154870, 158340, 'I started questioning gender-based assumptions a long time ago.'),
    ('be80a481-ed4d-59d6-a88b-86e1096d9982', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 11, 159150, 160580, 'When I was eight.'),
    ('30d8b41d-d48c-50dc-8260-f6839cd3b6d4', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 12, 161230, 164340, 'I was confused being called "bossy".'),
    ('510abf07-d29c-5c2a-999b-9d6d85d5888f', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 13, 164790, 169279, 'Because, I wanted to direct the plays that we would put on for our parents.'),
    ('6ff3b27f-bb7f-57fa-9da5-1d18760d9ea9', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 14, 169870, 171519, 'But the boys were not.'),
    ('035d7b61-84dc-52ac-ac7c-d66de6730381', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 15, 172650, 177360, 'When at fourteen, I started to be sexualized by certain elements of the media.'),
    ('4a17c0ec-c772-5f57-9462-a048b65dc753', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 16, 178570, 186140, 'When at fifteen, my girlfriends started dropping out of their beloved sports teams because they didn''t want to appear "muscle-y".'),
    ('e89f0e3c-7d25-5653-9ada-e10536f66acd', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 17, 187290, 192840, 'When at eighteen, my male friends were unable to express their feelings.'),
    ('ae344810-c54b-555b-b459-70e87b55ffae', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 18, 194590, 197520, 'I decided that I was a feminist.'),
    ('4d8967c3-94ae-589b-9c4b-bfff0ac81ccf', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 19, 198350, 200440, 'And this seemed uncomplicated to me.'),
    ('9091f976-60bf-5201-9519-949282b620a9', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 20, 201510, 208040, 'But my recent research has shown me that feminism has become an unpopular word.'),
    ('81f1115e-a5be-56ff-b1d3-f71120a807d5', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 21, 210510, 217879, 'Women are choosing not to identify as feminist.'),
    ('ade24aff-1c1f-5b5c-83b9-2422e14a02ef', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 22, 218270, 234359, 'Apparently, I am among the ranks of women whose expressions are seen as too strong Too aggressive, isolating, and anti-men.'),
    ('ff9d3dc1-5c8e-5f47-8e9b-f383fd50b639', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 23, 238110, 245339, 'Why has the word become such an uncomfortable one?'),
    ('b0df39fc-963b-5010-a59f-2604efec4056', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 24, 245570, 253910, 'I am from Britain and I think it is right that I am paid the same as my male counterparts.'),
    ('33a24749-c9b4-5217-9a58-da3ff77cf69b', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 25, 253910, 259140, 'I think it is right that I should be able to make decisions about my own body.'),
    ('82b0ca47-975a-51a0-865c-ffbe4c71610d', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 26, 280410, 288939, 'I think it is right that socially I am afforded the same respect as men.'),
    ('3849e1a2-f0eb-51a7-a83b-4a345895f306', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 27, 289410, 300659, 'But sadly, I can say that there is no one country in the world where all women can expect to receive these rights.'),
    ('0642498b-cd88-5c45-9163-58a9c5e208cf', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 28, 301770, 307920, 'No country in the world can yet say that they have achieved gender equality.'),
    ('7f51b3cb-3c39-5eca-b0e5-b7aa6426216a', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 29, 309670, 313420, 'These rights, I consider to be human rights.'),
    ('96c1ade4-20c0-5d95-a9b8-45b0f2aedf01', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 30, 314170, 316020, 'But I am one of the lucky ones.'),
    ('7261a27d-0e9e-56ad-8629-c8db093f0a01', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 31, 317210, 324859, 'My life is a sheer privilege because my parents didn''t love me less because I was born a daughter.'),
    ('77100c21-8214-5c9d-9f34-753c90389d5c', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 32, 325930, 331540, 'My school did not limit me because I was a girl.'),
    ('6b44c6a3-a778-5141-8bbd-ffd49e35f1ac', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 33, 331650, 340370, 'My mentors didn''t assume that I would go less far because I might give birth to a child one day.'),
    ('9ec88228-a5e2-5277-9b1e-e2381e26b6f2', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 34, 340370, 347530, 'These influences with the gender equality ambassadors, that made me who I am today.'),
    ('2d094951-809a-569d-96f1-e2972d2ea28f', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 35, 347530, 354659, 'They may not know it, but they are the inadvertent feminists who are changing the world today.'),
    ('b1ed925b-5fba-5850-815b-2ec3d659bd58', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 36, 354670, 364250, 'We need more of those, and if you still hate the word it is not the word that is important.'),
    ('65bbb94e-ae34-5adc-a166-d21d7be89486', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 37, 364250, 368019, 'It''s the idea and the ambition behind it.'),
    ('68a0c4fc-59d5-5d9f-82af-67d3b8c93ad2', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 38, 368850, 374330, 'Because not all women have received the same rights that I have.'),
    ('2cbb58fa-8da3-57c1-88db-1fb485fed203', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 39, 374330, 381600, 'In fact, statistically very few have been.'),
    ('7de04d5b-b195-5f1f-af94-2036aff2bce0', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 40, 388510, 395670, 'Sadly many of the things that she wanted to change are still true today.'),
    ('a46b6c4a-c0f7-5f55-bb38-c06ee9bc2299', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 41, 395670, 406070, 'But what stood out for me the most, was that less than thirty percent of the audience were male.'),
    ('a06e44d4-32ab-5754-99d9-9917fc40bf62', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 42, 406070, 411559, 'How can we affect change in the world when only half of it is invited?'),
    ('d05bc659-7fed-519b-ae14-32445620c3fc', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 43, 411850, 417150, 'Or feel welcomed to participate in a conversation?'),
    ('bd6fda47-c5ff-5b26-b1aa-2de6d13c76f0', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 44, 417150, 426719, 'Men, I would like to take this opportunity to extend your formal invitation.'),
    ('ea3ee451-420d-5f70-b504-aea8d75227d2', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 45, 426750, 443460, '*really loud applause* *applause dies down* Gender equality is your issue too.'),
    ('8a6520de-d004-5dda-93c1-a551d83b9c9f', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 46, 443630, 451890, 'Because to date, I have seen my father''s role as a parent being valued less by society.'),
    ('225b3583-b9d9-5746-bff4-6169e4493334', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 47, 451890, 456750, 'Despite my needing his presence as a child as much as my mother''s.'),
    ('632381fa-0ffa-5bde-a137-115f23d96509', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 48, 456750, 461575, 'I''ve seen young men suffering from mental illness,'),
    ('aa9ce976-4841-5d1b-8bcd-ad6efb400af1', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 49, 461575, 469570, 'unable to ask for help for fear it would make them less of a men or less of a man.'),
    ('8b5f7284-1d0a-5575-8e97-979947cb65a6', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 50, 469570, 484450, 'In fact, in the UK suicide is the biggest killer of men between twenty to forty-nine eclipsing road accidents, cancer, and coronary heart disease.'),
    ('401af33b-a83e-575c-88d2-a4a307d67007', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 51, 484450, 494170, 'I''ve seen men made fragile and insecure by distorted sense of what constitutes male success.'),
    ('162af164-e030-59a8-8e0d-9bcd12eb670a', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 52, 494170, 499900, 'Men don''t have the benefits of equality either.'),
    ('20b0ef35-fb9e-575c-9617-100250ad2da4', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 53, 500010, 508060, 'We don''t often talk about men being imprisoned by gender stereotypes, but I can see that they are.'),
    ('4f5e0853-b2bd-536d-8020-e5665e60d738', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 54, 508090, 515820, 'And that when they are free, things will change for women as a natural consequence.'),
    ('b751014f-1da7-5138-a245-52afb25c7190', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 55, 515830, 524630, 'If men don''t have to be aggressive in order to be accepted, women won''t feel compelled to be submissive.'),
    ('6737db75-8bbb-5e40-90d4-4d988396087c', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 56, 524630, 530680, 'If men don''t have to control, women won''t have to be controlled.'),
    ('91db010b-4aa5-5d4d-a142-9173509d1125', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 57, 530710, 534640, 'Both men and women should feel free to be sensitive.'),
    ('8c8841cf-82a2-52ad-aa63-9e4aec334ebb', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 58, 534730, 538299, 'Both men and women should feel free to be strong.'),
    ('7095a4ab-a334-5dc6-bd1d-fd0c97a0beab', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 59, 539410, 546860, 'It is time that we all perceived gender on a spectrum instead of two sets of opposing ideals.'),
    ('c3de7219-a8de-5a3c-a4fd-dce3fcb1738a', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 60, 548270, 564320, 'If- *gets cutoff again* *clapping* If we stop defining each other by what we are not and start defining ourselves by who we are we can all be free-er.'),
    ('1a9678ab-363e-5cf4-83ea-1f488f4ebb51', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 61, 565350, 568399, 'And this is what HeForShe is about.'),
    ('0831f074-3352-5398-bc44-aa9c274caa91', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 62, 569790, 571500, 'It''s about freedom.'),
    ('0bb7da36-14cb-5663-bfe2-36f59b9d45b9', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 63, 572910, 579760, 'I want men to take up this mantle, so that their daughters, sisters, and mothers can be free from prejudice.'),
    ('ab73b02b-bf45-50fc-af6d-cd3276e4eee7', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 64, 580170, 585400, 'But also so that their sons have permission to be vulnerable and human too.'),
    ('875c1b38-3c63-5fbd-9e76-91918010d6ff', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 65, 586210, 589020, 'We claim those parts of themselves they abandoned.'),
    ('6d4a2a79-4129-5854-9cb3-3c5f3ec907b6', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 66, 589410, 596599, 'And in doing so, be a more true and complete version of themselves.'),
    ('af17881d-0c6f-5f45-81c6-73f54b455b7c', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 67, 596810, 600575, 'You might be thinking "Who is this Harry Potter girl?"'),
    ('96c91339-cec3-57e2-8d6d-f81dba04383a', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 68, 600575, 603587, 'and "What is she doing speaking at the UN?"'),
    ('2149641f-0090-56cf-9ed1-274eadba464b', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 69, 603587, 605860, 'and it''s really good question.'),
    ('61e8b0fb-d2e0-59e3-ad01-a4d091fee35c', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 70, 606090, 609840, 'I''ve been asking myself the same thing.'),
    ('8cbe7bd0-a494-5fec-bb0e-80c2b210fbb1', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 71, 609910, 616459, 'All I know is that I care about this problem and I want to make it better.'),
    ('6e5ace5f-5d85-5b51-a73d-247014d8d6ee', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 72, 616490, 627040, 'And having seen what I seen and given the chance, I feel it is my responsibility to say something.'),
    ('e099490f-3dbf-555c-89e1-38d6c392dd0e', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 73, 627130, 640060, 'Statesman Edmund Berke said "All that is needed for the forces of evil to triumph is for good men and women to do nothing."'),
    ('67bb157e-f6e2-59f3-87a5-944aec000cf6', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 74, 640230, 653419, 'In my nervousness for this speech and in my moments of doubt, I''ve told myself firmly: "If not me, who?"'),
    ('15ad4d37-3f1f-5790-96e8-bcdb98eddb2d', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 75, 653690, 657640, '"If not now, when?"'),
    ('1015313a-42b0-57f6-91d9-83b0493cb2a4', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 76, 657730, 667479, 'If you have similar doubts when opportunities are presented to you, I hope that those words will be helpful.'),
    ('e01729fd-780f-58fb-882e-257ca33fd24e', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 77, 685670, 688280, 'For the same work.'),
    ('30eacd2c-382d-53e7-8983-2da6aab201d7', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 78, 688430, 695520, 'Fifteen-point-five million girls will be married in the next sixteen years as children.'),
    ('bd18b935-869c-5012-8f7c-4954dd5d6198', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 79, 708750, 721150, 'If you believe in equality, you might be one of those inadvertent feminists that I spoke of earlier and for this I applaud you.'),
    ('6795d932-71d4-505a-a8ea-c5139742eba3', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 80, 721150, 730340, 'We are struggling for a uniting word but the good news is that we have a uniting movement.'),
    ('571f5ee9-717c-5272-87fe-000a6cdbeef8', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 81, 730370, 734079, 'It is called HeForShe.'),
    ('a558880b-d48a-56b4-9908-bc3d1eef0899', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 82, 734150, 746240, 'I am inviting you to step forward, to be seen, and to ask yourself "If not me, who?"'),
    ('191c313f-393e-5f57-9731-10e4777769f4', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 83, 746290, 750040, '"If not now, when?"'),
    ('6264cf05-6e00-57b6-b9ed-c376248b4694', 'gkjW9PZBRfk', 84, 750490, 752120, 'Thank you very very much.'),
    ('6c711a68-4239-59da-83eb-addebeb0a829', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 1, 29390, 33239, 'H I barely slept last night.'),
    ('a5f70e1d-24a3-522f-a39a-473d6cd596c3', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 2, 33239, 37619, 'I was thinking about my project.'),
    ('f94c0a86-2f4d-50bd-b8b9-938c71c068f5', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 3, 37619, 39477, 'I know, love.'),
    ('5817c3e8-b85a-579f-86e8-a6c92b768274', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 4, 39477, 47605, 'I heard you get up in the middle of the night, but I made your coffee.'),
    ('8b9a5362-e45a-502c-bd4d-de990148373b', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 5, 47605, 52785, 'It''s hot and waiting for you on the table.'),
    ('79afa042-664f-5199-9927-a7675b7fa74d', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 6, 53715, 56415, 'You made my coffee?'),
    ('890536ec-8e41-5f73-94c0-7439a32ee411', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 7, 56415, 61275, 'You are the best wife in the world.'),
    ('f3447270-f1e5-5940-9abd-c23d2b0f8a5d', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 8, 61275, 64957, 'Okay, I''m getting up now.'),
    ('8e655300-9ea9-5971-8c92-bfe2d8bbdbb0', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 9, 65924, 68018, 'That''s my man.'),
    ('0bd01aac-474f-5249-920b-119e319ceab1', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 10, 68018, 70950, 'The day is starting.'),
    ('5d00c269-59de-5653-9ed1-9cadc1acbff9', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 11, 70950, 74160, 'We can do it together.'),
    ('15437e86-152c-5c1f-a905-2b57755920ab', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 12, 74160, 78603, 'I will make us some toast now.'),
    ('31c2d5e1-3644-5dbf-80ec-3367a032381a', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 13, 78603, 81529, 'You are the best.'),
    ('0b3c2df6-bdd8-50cf-b95d-b0c52dcaea11', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 14, 81529, 83481, 'I love you.'),
    ('7aa06ae1-8e37-5634-a1ce-5e9138f922f3', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 15, 83481, 86245, 'I love you, too.'),
    ('597b98ee-d5bb-5517-948a-16b52f1c3f44', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 16, 86245, 92899, 'Now hurry or your coffee will get cold.'),
    ('41502441-e750-57c7-9ecc-a7d2efae69f0', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 17, 94710, 97510, 'Did you sleep well?'),
    ('f9c7dc7f-862b-5cc5-a888-0f40656146a9', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 18, 97510, 99480, 'Yeah, I did.'),
    ('17eb49d3-1c01-5e85-b169-2bad48b8fa4c', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 19, 100450, 104090, 'Something smells amazing.'),
    ('21ae2344-c457-511f-9ef2-375a418a6123', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 20, 104090, 107566, 'I made scrambled eggs and toast.'),
    ('6d2806b7-fb4a-5c53-be4e-53b01ab2a87b', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 21, 107566, 109444, 'Want some coffee?'),
    ('e40bd2a4-bacd-53a8-850f-4e68dd5a5418', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 22, 110542, 114820, 'You know, I can''t start my day without it.'),
    ('323f2389-9fbe-50e6-9b86-a35474b8dede', 'hGt8njnS1R8', 23, 117040, 118832, 'Here you go.'),
