    ('3a1e12fd-ca50-5f24-9b82-961ec702a033', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 5, 55400, 57846, 'And she said, "I''m going to call you a storyteller."'),
    ('8c9b9573-0331-54be-848f-ac627d896d6d', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 6, 57846, 60844, 'And I was like, "Why not ''magic pixie''?"'),
    ('929effa7-4c18-583a-9715-705360e78db6', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 7, 63598, 67025, 'I was like, "Let me think about this for a second."'),
    ('1ce911f4-5507-509e-a380-b46fdeb136e1', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 8, 67241, 69804, 'I tried to call deep on my courage.'),
    ('4dc200cb-273b-5b3a-abd9-735ba47f9b31', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 9, 69804, 72940, 'And I thought, you know, I am a storyteller.'),
    ('1ef0a44f-9cef-5b9d-8c37-bb6a0617993b', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 10, 79660, 81940, 'And maybe I''m just a storyteller.'),
    ('b7bc0a60-f2be-5a75-8d9a-447d962ad422', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 11, 81940, 83623, 'And so I said, "You know what?'),
    ('fd000bac-679c-5685-acab-f61d3debdf4c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 12, 83623, 86288, 'Why don''t you just say I''m a researcher-storyteller."'),
    ('a410f8cf-d247-5cf7-9119-2abfc7f2c9d8', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 13, 86288, 88023, 'And she went, "Ha ha.'),
    ('915a7f1f-19ea-5a38-93cc-50fd909640dd', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 14, 88023, 90066, 'There''s no such thing."'),
    ('f3973b7b-b86b-580f-8f05-d7ddf1e37417', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 15, 91647, 93645, 'So I''m a researcher-storyteller,'),
    ('aaddf3fb-7a38-5c25-b964-52e3c5c4db1b', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 16, 110043, 112325, 'And this is where my story starts.'),
    ('8f667c01-76f7-5bf1-ad42-42b76a58e85b', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 17, 112940, 120801, 'When I was a young researcher, doctoral student, my first year, I had a research professor who said to us, "Here''s the thing,'),
    ('7e62001f-ffc1-59ef-acc9-3650043b1585', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 18, 120801, 123744, 'if you cannot measure it, it does not exist."'),
    ('bcd16098-00a1-530b-a5f5-184f89aadfb1', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 19, 125324, 128066, 'And I thought he was just sweet-talking me.'),
    ('2ce5fa09-0b89-51f2-9eda-ee1b4baeb962', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 20, 128289, 129300, 'I was like, "Really?"'),
    ('424d178d-1830-56b9-af04-860669731dde', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 21, 129300, 130750, 'and he was like, "Absolutely."'),
    ('81295178-d395-5754-ac46-f41c537753b0', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 22, 130750, 136896, 'And so you have to understand that I have a bachelor''s and a master''s in social work, and I was getting my Ph.D.'),
    ('c590f017-daf3-5e7d-be7b-00c80a531f24', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 23, 136896, 144796, 'in social work, so my entire academic career was surrounded by people who kind of believed in the "life''s messy, love it."'),
    ('9fedc7c0-f1d1-5b76-a14e-40c6320c87ce', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 24, 145424, 152802, 'And I''m more of the, "life''s messy, clean it up, organize it and put it into a bento box."'),
    ('36e270db-f0b8-51f3-b769-a7825f53c516', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 25, 154970, 160838, 'And so to think that I had found my way, to found a career that takes me -- really,'),
    ('9ff0f558-47bd-560e-b52a-355fb2bd188f', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 26, 160838, 165907, 'one of the big sayings in social work is, "Lean into the discomfort of the work."'),
    ('ae66b647-1ea4-5bef-8a2c-024b896e9c05', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 27, 166487, 171345, 'And I''m like, knock discomfort upside the head and move it over and get all A''s.'),
    ('88e877b5-0008-5014-9531-8cae49f19fb4', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 28, 171345, 173406, 'That was my mantra.'),
    ('c166153b-882f-53a4-aabe-f52e2a3861c0', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 29, 174940, 176940, 'So I was very excited about this.'),
    ('a07d5779-0145-5253-8660-0dd5f4e8d6d4', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 30, 176940, 182940, 'And so I thought, you know what, this is the career for me, because I am interested in some messy topics.'),
    ('c68d05e7-1c58-580a-a8a3-d5e971496ebf', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 31, 182940, 185335, 'But I want to be able to make them not messy.'),
    ('36f81929-e84e-5b1f-b1d1-64c680cf63b7', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 32, 185335, 186681, 'I want to understand them.'),
    ('377ced48-ed49-5afa-bad6-c996afbf385a', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 33, 186681, 192408, 'I want to hack into these things that I know are important and lay the code out for everyone to see.'),
    ('60824733-633a-5e05-bcff-5b158ce3cc96', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 34, 192940, 195749, 'So where I started was with connection.'),
    ('e5a33697-ec25-5d4f-9aac-73a9c6d74a1c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 35, 203790, 206319, 'It''s what gives purpose and meaning to our lives.'),
    ('e373cd03-5102-5709-8b26-d096a35908c9', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 36, 207026, 208836, 'This is what it''s all about.'),
    ('52db96df-55ac-5389-b4ee-4f706591a07a', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 37, 208836, 216590, 'It doesn''t matter whether you talk to people who work in social justice, mental health and abuse and neglect, what we know is that connection,'),
    ('57f27dae-782c-5413-bf4b-f72478892f22', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 38, 216590, 223343, 'the ability to feel connected, is -- neurobiologically that''s how we''re wired -- it''s why we''re here.'),
    ('2597d9ee-947c-5800-9c73-dd5ac46aaee7', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 39, 223343, 226505, 'So I thought, you know what, I''m going to start with connection.'),
    ('abd9654d-879b-580a-822c-8c8ab1438c94', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 40, 234280, 236803, 'and one "opportunity for growth?"'),
    ('dd3ff306-f83d-55f4-a7bc-67d4b2e3f617', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 41, 239146, 242638, 'And all you can think about is that opportunity for growth, right?'),
    ('dc78d35d-d78d-56be-8a08-10e63438163d', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 42, 242638, 250361, 'Well, apparently this is the way my work went as well, because, when you ask people about love, they tell you about heartbreak.'),
    ('233e43d2-3311-581f-855a-7f8961ae588d', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 43, 250361, 256995, 'When you ask people about belonging, they''ll tell you their most excruciating experiences of being excluded.'),
    ('e901e4dd-627a-5d69-a175-46b4b3f64b0d', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 44, 256995, 262208, 'And when you ask people about connection, the stories they told me were about disconnection.'),
    ('8b865e38-959a-5efb-9304-038ff7f17482', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 45, 263068, 274772, 'So very quickly -- really about six weeks into this research -- I ran into this unnamed thing that absolutely unraveled connection in a way that I didn''t understand or had never seen.'),
    ('24a1428b-4b52-5aa2-bb2c-a373db89d4ce', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 46, 275059, 279314, 'And so I pulled back out of the research and thought, I need to figure out what this is.'),
    ('d8351490-11e5-5cbb-84d7-a82e1d6ae1b1', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 47, 279314, 281643, 'And it turned out to be shame.'),
    ('dd13620d-612f-51e9-9978-2c31411289cc', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 48, 283162, 291743, 'And shame is really easily understood as the fear of disconnection: Is there something about me that, if other people know it or see it,'),
    ('d6bcaafa-b063-5b24-8885-f482130de1cd', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 49, 291743, 295059, 'that I won''t be worthy of connection?'),
    ('748195d6-4192-5f55-a30e-6d3029b387da', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 50, 295543, 298940, 'The things I can tell you about it: It''s universal; we all have it.'),
    ('be9d0f8d-a503-5a18-b963-8fd48e3a454e', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 51, 298940, 303322, 'The only people who don''t experience shame have no capacity for human empathy or connection.'),
    ('0c0341f1-4cf7-51f3-a41a-c43d5925714d', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 52, 303322, 307661, 'No one wants to talk about it, and the less you talk about it, the more you have it.'),
    ('006c1edc-3f53-5412-a900-c80eeef76524', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 53, 308955, 316844, 'What underpinned this shame, this "I''m not good enough," -- which, we all know that feeling: "I''m not blank enough.'),
    ('7985c1c8-c2e9-504a-89ce-2067acdcc647', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 54, 316844, 321124, 'I''m not thin enough, rich enough, beautiful enough, smart enough, promoted enough."'),
    ('9b4a8c59-5de6-57e8-abf4-d1b070ededfa', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 55, 321124, 326250, 'The thing that underpinned this was excruciating vulnerability.'),
    ('67b6fdcd-429b-5fb3-b0d0-5cefd648aa59', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 56, 326812, 334835, 'This idea of, in order for connection to happen, we have to allow ourselves to be seen, really seen.'),
    ('b1196a1b-dbe3-59e4-b373-cc6154be85e5', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 57, 336011, 338158, 'And you know how I feel about vulnerability.'),
    ('71fcd70f-470b-5440-ab92-1ed2092ef71e', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 58, 338158, 339233, 'I hate vulnerability.'),
    ('6a019359-426b-50d0-8cd9-49a5f8fcdb18', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 59, 339233, 343755, 'And so I thought, this is my chance to beat it back with my measuring stick.'),
    ('e82e7d38-73f6-5dd2-b8da-b5541235d513', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 60, 343755, 349804, 'I''m going in, I''m going to figure this stuff out, I''m going to spend a year, I''m going to totally deconstruct shame,'),
    ('076c7527-2818-59ae-a685-1a77750a4a9f', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 61, 349804, 353690, 'I''m going to understand how vulnerability works, and I''m going to outsmart it.'),
    ('d8088b7a-4c72-5a86-8f91-3e5e7e2e33d9', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 62, 354590, 357010, 'So I was ready, and I was really excited.'),
    ('3ee3ba93-98a3-536c-915a-9c37884b9804', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 63, 360189, 362482, 'As you know, it''s not going to turn out well.'),
    ('515b2bc2-18bf-522a-bcf4-9cd7a149d32c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 64, 364893, 366511, 'You know this.'),
    ('5aa925b6-2078-5343-8a9a-922cd1e66177', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 65, 366511, 370671, 'So, I could tell you a lot about shame, but I''d have to borrow everyone else''s time.'),
    ('b442ffee-00c6-59ba-aed5-b6313e6d91cb', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 66, 380018, 388940, 'My one year turned into six years: Thousands of stories, hundreds of long interviews, focus groups.'),
    ('b8e658da-f5ab-5043-bcb6-85ddef59cc6b', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 67, 388940, 397222, 'At one point, people were sending me journal pages and sending me their stories -- thousands of pieces of data in six years.'),
    ('a0571481-6469-5acf-91c7-6b500d41db1a', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 68, 397222, 398940, 'And I kind of got a handle on it.'),
    ('770ba650-459c-521b-8a0c-79f6d0dcae90', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 69, 398940, 402188, 'I kind of understood, this is what shame is, this is how it works.'),
    ('0e0d84c8-3eee-5050-975b-d9d144138396', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 70, 403402, 411200, 'I wrote a book, I published a theory, but something was not okay -- and what it was is that,'),
    ('97087326-82cd-56bc-a8dd-da1d1781506e', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 71, 411200, 421999, 'if I roughly took the people I interviewed and divided them into people who really have a sense of worthiness -- that''s what this comes down to,'),
    ('ad9cc372-ae63-5cd4-9fb2-b6a37165bb6e', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 72, 421999, 428156, 'a sense of worthiness -- they have a strong sense of love and belonging -- and folks who struggle for it,'),
    ('3b573d94-a047-506e-abb1-d138d691c70f', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 73, 428156, 431280, 'and folks who are always wondering if they''re good enough.'),
    ('c3730454-adc4-5c1b-98c7-44e64f998932', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 74, 431280, 438590, 'There was only one variable that separated the people who have a strong sense of love and belonging and the people who really struggle for it.'),
    ('cb732dbc-2be7-5d68-8569-b0c60301fd81', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 75, 438590, 444886, 'And that was, the people who have a strong sense of love and belonging believe they''re worthy of love and belonging.'),
    ('02ac86d4-0572-5365-9c9f-d879b5c0b23c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 76, 447455, 449093, 'They believe they''re worthy.'),
    ('c608be6f-c8b8-54c3-9080-e96d06e1f6c0', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 77, 450686, 459767, 'And to me, the hard part of the one thing that keeps us out of connection is our fear that we''re not worthy of connection,'),
    ('0009dc30-6c31-5e33-aca8-b973b3a83602', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 78, 459767, 464565, 'was something that, personally and professionally, I felt like I needed to understand better.'),
    ('5fd29e60-88ee-5411-ac1e-81ebf2f625bd', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 79, 464757, 472600, 'So what I did is I took all of the interviews where I saw worthiness, where I saw people living that way,'),
    ('2ed3d91d-a532-5696-8b62-a439286d8d8a', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 80, 472600, 474638, 'and just looked at those.'),
    ('3bacbfa4-2613-50be-b41e-97e5016c68c8', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 81, 475264, 477336, 'What do these people have in common?'),
    ('cdfcc232-2fad-5416-bc53-fc7a63023109', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 82, 477336, 482003, 'I have a slight office supply addiction, but that''s another talk.'),
    ('90d68293-9850-5e4b-8230-7009ebd8dbb7', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 83, 482003, 488148, 'So I had a manila folder, and I had a Sharpie, and I was like, what am I going to call this research?'),
    ('56ef3a1a-a162-5895-bef2-595327379009', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 84, 488148, 491287, 'And the first words that came to my mind were "whole-hearted."'),
    ('15042906-2a48-5b03-af87-48e1e5798897', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 85, 491757, 495297, 'These are whole-hearted people, living from this deep sense of worthiness.'),
    ('9cbb637c-4d62-5df1-8f49-07ba69e072f5', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 86, 495297, 500130, 'So I wrote at the top of the manila folder, and I started looking at the data.'),
    ('2e3e6a87-9e91-5d35-bbb8-00dd10f63e55', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 87, 500130, 509748, 'In fact, I did it first in a four-day, very intensive data analysis, where I went back, pulled the interviews, the stories, pulled the incidents.'),
    ('7cef5e2a-f399-5490-83f8-45a78a3bf70a', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 88, 510590, 511676, 'What''s the pattern?'),
    ('c9dd2663-b2af-54d9-a424-1aad6187c929', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 89, 512320, 522217, 'My husband left town with the kids because I always go into this Jackson Pollock crazy thing, where I''m just writing and in my researcher mode.'),
    ('fe200f53-b118-5b68-a65e-55d47942b262', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 90, 523575, 525272, 'And so here''s what I found.'),
    ('904895a5-da1f-5e89-815e-3bb48399396c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 91, 528064, 531066, 'What they had in common was a sense of courage.'),
    ('6889d875-f54f-5265-9aa6-117a68b2ee88', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 92, 531574, 534695, 'And I want to separate courage and bravery for you for a minute.'),
    ('6412119c-80e8-5fc7-ad0e-3e2dd6b69414', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 93, 534695, 540899, 'Courage, the original definition of courage, when it first came into the English language -- it''s from the Latin word "cor,"'),
    ('646df302-4962-5b39-a029-3f209dab937c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 94, 540899, 546398, 'meaning "heart" -- and the original definition was to tell the story of who you are with your whole heart.'),
    ('f28f1361-97ef-58d6-bccc-93997ff0f698', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 95, 547009, 551333, 'And so these folks had, very simply, the courage to be imperfect.'),
    ('984e9d33-2aeb-5ff4-982c-53291eb6c155', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 96, 553582, 559806, 'They had the compassion to be kind to themselves first and then to others, because, as it turns out,'),
    ('da08515f-837d-5d69-b869-19f70605ea00', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 97, 559806, 563957, 'we can''t practice compassion with other people if we can''t treat ourselves kindly.'),
    ('91e0afce-8cd0-5d66-8c54-d455368fb7c9', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 98, 564209, 571631, 'And the last was they had connection, and -- this was the hard part -- as a result of authenticity,'),
    ('d96f8e66-680b-52bf-b0e4-4038d044cf3c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 99, 571631, 577001, 'they were willing to let go of who they thought they should be in order to be who they were,'),
    ('47584201-6504-55fb-97ff-48513ad94aa3', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 100, 577001, 580891, 'which you have to absolutely do that for connection.'),
    ('0b18c904-92b7-526e-a3e8-a0fd31f40404', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 101, 583273, 594090, 'The other thing that they had in common was this: They fully embraced vulnerability.'),
    ('eb58a390-47e6-5b7f-af1a-d01cb32d1284', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 102, 595629, 602430, 'They believed that what made them vulnerable made them beautiful.'),
    ('19c22adf-4959-5772-8ecc-a3d8132b11a4', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 103, 606091, 609940, 'They didn''t talk about vulnerability being comfortable,'),
    ('65cca6de-ef54-53ca-9b40-fb306c6b6c57', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 104, 609940, 615292, 'nor did they really talk about it being excruciating -- as I had heard it earlier in the shame interviewing.'),
    ('d0887718-0868-500e-a195-a858dec70c49', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 105, 615292, 617672, 'They just talked about it being necessary.'),
    ('f4460c77-1995-5e66-8b34-2ff75d9b11fb', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 106, 618583, 622709, 'They talked about the willingness to say, "I love you" first...'),
    ('2e6d4970-2f7c-55e5-9cbb-ddc3d5c8944a', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 107, 624328, 629851, 'the willingness to do something where there are no guarantees...'),
    ('080d0b5f-478a-516f-a175-1d7849f5f9e2', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 108, 631233, 637025, 'the willingness to breathe through waiting for the doctor to call after your mammogram.'),
    ('02a08889-b679-5cee-a263-c7e015cded0c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 109, 638581, 643470, 'They''re willing to invest in a relationship that may or may not work out.'),
    ('48f11b2a-893b-5b5e-bd90-30af1932ebd4', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 110, 644415, 646435, 'They thought this was fundamental.'),
    ('1aa634aa-5c02-5f13-90d3-dc8d3f13f902', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 111, 647392, 650161, 'I personally thought it was betrayal.'),
    ('cf3f78f9-3f34-59a1-aee6-2ed919e18567', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 112, 650797, 659505, 'I could not believe I had pledged allegiance to research, where our job -- you know, the definition of research is to control and predict,'),
    ('2338b21e-e903-597a-a00a-11ea3442263f', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 113, 659505, 664172, 'to study phenomena for the explicit reason to control and predict.'),
    ('4e0d065f-bea4-59c0-ae97-2e1b890fdd93', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 114, 664172, 674277, 'And now my mission to control and predict had turned up the answer that the way to live is with vulnerability and to stop controlling and predicting.'),
    ('2b3fe94a-5639-5afb-a741-e4b01d45cb3b', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 115, 674277, 685066, 'This led to a little breakdown -- -- which actually looked more like this.'),
    ('16f36393-03e7-5d6a-9bd5-0d4ed68c5914', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 116, 686457, 688458, 'And it did.'),
    ('2d7d1622-af26-53e5-ba38-af80665c76a4', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 117, 688458, 691788, 'I call it a breakdown; my therapist calls it a spiritual awakening.'),
    ('7fbb11fb-7edb-5675-aa4c-62713eaa9de6', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 118, 692920, 697162, 'A spiritual awakening sounds better than breakdown, but I assure you, it was a breakdown.'),
    ('65c17547-7d2a-5e27-8fe0-5da79f36c16c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 119, 697162, 700090, 'And I had to put my data away and go find a therapist.'),
    ('0b775549-da79-5eda-a1f6-d7f6aac31e4e', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 120, 700090, 705609, 'Let me tell you something: you know who you are when you call your friends and say, "I think I need to see somebody.'),
    ('f78e62d7-c27b-5543-b6a1-c12d720c0ddb', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 121, 705609, 707565, 'Do you have any recommendations?"'),
    ('f0021c6f-ee01-55ec-8029-b3e624f87093', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 122, 714442, 716443, 'I was like, "What does that mean?"'),
    ('7e50e26c-1bac-5534-a8c3-fe481a4603cd', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 123, 716443, 719674, 'And they''re like, "I''m just saying, you know.'),
    ('d2952a12-62c7-598d-a1a0-77af434c52e9', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 124, 719674, 721800, 'Don''t bring your measuring stick."'),
    ('515da0b8-abfb-50b3-b0e4-cfcab1bf60fa', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 125, 724435, 725785, 'I was like, "Okay."'),
    ('e4742ca5-727e-5615-b233-4716893b3058', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 126, 726495, 728353, 'So I found a therapist.'),
    ('5ac32495-997c-5136-8f16-7678007a7437', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 127, 728353, 736377, 'My first meeting with her, Diana -- I brought in my list of the way the whole-hearted live, and I sat down.'),
    ('bbb3af90-d7a9-5e2c-bab3-953baa0aa3cc', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 128, 736377, 738210, 'And she said, "How are you?"'),
    ('3f434730-29e8-5e60-9aad-0151b5f9c63e', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 129, 738210, 740825, 'And I said, "I''m great.'),
    ('e866c977-29bc-5c91-b268-896e208612cc', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 130, 741829, 743377, 'She said, "What''s going on?"'),
    ('57507c14-7b64-5ef4-acd5-e2e34a972dfa', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 131, 743377, 749929, 'And this is a therapist who sees therapists, because we have to go to those, because their B.S.'),
    ('d234b041-b5ae-518f-affe-c95e5086cf6e', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 132, 749929, 751382, 'meters are good.'),
    ('2fee1b11-753a-5330-80eb-f2fd67afc0ff', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 133, 753686, 757543, 'And so I said, "Here''s the thing, I''m struggling."'),
    ('e5700c18-44c1-5c69-9829-48445031695c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 134, 757543, 759502, 'And she said, "What''s the struggle?"'),
    ('4c566d67-7324-5901-969b-48394cefbb6a', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 135, 760392, 762677, 'And I said, "Well, I have a vulnerability issue.'),
    ('63db4062-2e2f-5c89-800d-b4943b17f42f', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 136, 762677, 769677, 'And I know that vulnerability is the core of shame and fear and our struggle for worthiness,'),
    ('875cc2e1-ce04-5175-b446-b4f0d8a48da8', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 137, 769677, 777503, 'but it appears that it''s also the birthplace of joy, of creativity, of belonging, of love.'),
    ('585f180e-1bd6-5b62-8c59-cdc3c0843d6f', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 138, 777726, 783186, 'And I think I have a problem, and I need some help."'),
    ('e4003932-9e96-5e62-a8f7-ef4ac356ed71', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 139, 783186, 788503, 'And I said, "But here''s the thing: no family stuff, no childhood shit."'),
    ('282abb0f-d413-5912-888e-37c9d0d67c6b', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 140, 790377, 793503, '"I just need some strategies."'),
    ('dec0c2e1-0d84-5791-a532-a95c7c8843d3', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 141, 804233, 805860, 'So she goes like this.'),
    ('4f9ef7c3-91e5-59d6-8d29-31609e41b5a8', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 142, 809757, 812377, 'And then I said, "It''s bad, right?"'),
    ('a22da7b2-ee0d-537b-b05c-d79efd8240ba', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 143, 812377, 815503, 'And she said, "It''s neither good nor bad."'),
    ('f2a4b649-5deb-56fb-ba83-a9e27e42ebe3', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 144, 817234, 819018, '"It just is what it is."'),
    ('6fa8f3ee-1647-55b0-949c-82f789dca4ab', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 145, 819614, 822503, 'And I said, "Oh my God, this is going to suck."'),
    ('e5fd64ce-27d3-5f93-a25f-0c2dadcae753', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 146, 825543, 827821, 'And it did, and it didn''t.'),
    ('146d4038-83ed-56c3-b2a5-74a06245d509', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 147, 827821, 829908, 'And it took about a year.'),
    ('64cab0ca-7189-54c1-9d7d-667037beaadc', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 148, 829908, 838177, 'And you know how there are people that, when they realize that vulnerability and tenderness are important, that they surrender and walk into it.'),
    ('279d1261-5ebe-5977-9c85-0243c8c15b7f', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 149, 846377, 848613, 'For me, it was a yearlong street fight.'),
    ('f67e7c59-2457-5499-84ca-d8e0a135ef81', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 150, 849702, 851026, 'It was a slugfest.'),
    ('79ce6744-cdf7-5a53-916a-361846349898', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 151, 851289, 853273, 'Vulnerability pushed, I pushed back.'),
    ('0233c4e8-bc62-5fc5-b45c-b2d78ac3f118', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 152, 853543, 858503, 'I lost the fight, but probably won my life back.'),
    ('536dcbf6-d7df-5e63-99ea-7d640d8e7b9c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 153, 858677, 865377, 'And so then I went back into the research and spent the next couple of years really trying to understand what they, the whole-hearted,'),
    ('11a93c73-c031-56f2-9225-9ad35e584746', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 154, 865377, 871377, 'what choices they were making, and what we are doing with vulnerability.'),
    ('ee1a71e7-df12-5248-a0ff-41a50370ff23', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 155, 871377, 873741, 'Why do we struggle with it so much?'),
    ('af5e2557-ef4d-5120-910a-7592824f2fd4', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 156, 873741, 876052, 'Am I alone in struggling with vulnerability?'),
    ('b56f38fa-c708-5e74-947e-c9c08019ce30', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 157, 877140, 879988, 'No. So this is what I learned.'),
    ('c9afbe2e-b7ab-5ab9-870a-a32a31a87234', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 158, 881909, 886241, 'We numb vulnerability -- when we''re waiting for the call.'),
    ('3d2b1b04-3417-5a0d-a3a0-b63601a32ded', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 159, 886241, 891452, 'It was funny, I sent something out on Twitter and on Facebook that says, "How would you define vulnerability?'),
    ('7904dc99-e6bb-5dfa-95b4-5c2cd2000cce', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 160, 891452, 893150, 'What makes you feel vulnerable?"'),
    ('3549a968-a9d9-58b0-b490-26f112febc5a', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 161, 895772, 898894, 'Because I wanted to know what''s out there.'),
    ('43c3c122-ffe7-519e-b6d0-50f98db91968', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 162, 901154, 910970, 'Having to ask my husband for help because I''m sick, and we''re newly married; initiating sex with my husband; initiating sex with my wife;'),
    ('325a87a8-948f-554b-add1-5be16b9f9320', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 163, 910970, 918401, 'being turned down; asking someone out; waiting for the doctor to call back; getting laid off; laying off people.'),
    ('fd2f47d0-f474-5cc8-8264-8a820d34d123', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 164, 918401, 919955, 'This is the world we live in.'),
    ('63261610-4a74-5d4e-afed-86043c1abf63', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 165, 920912, 923904, 'We live in a vulnerable world.'),
    ('5266bf89-009e-58aa-8b2f-aca4d8aa6b16', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 166, 923904, 926990, 'And one of the ways we deal with it is we numb vulnerability.'),
    ('83ca339c-c183-590d-9110-38f0b9de2961', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 167, 927638, 931782, 'And I think there''s evidence -- and it''s not the only reason this evidence exists,'),
    ('1ec47785-e0a0-5e4b-b4cc-479f612d5a9c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 168, 931782, 936954, 'but I think it''s a huge cause -- We are the most in-debt...'),
    ('26741fe6-99c3-5771-ac65-27b7c7064bcd', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 169, 940860, 945169, 'addicted and medicated adult cohort in U.S. history.'),
    ('b6d3165b-bf09-53e9-b715-4ecf43e207a7', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 170, 948265, 954852, 'The problem is -- and I learned this from the research -- that you cannot selectively numb emotion.'),
    ('a1029ee5-f8ff-5099-b032-d105257461f5', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 171, 955241, 957724, 'You can''t say, here''s the bad stuff.'),
    ('52e685ac-8055-5e21-b77e-a730fa0b3de6', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 172, 958377, 962477, 'Here''s vulnerability, here''s grief, here''s shame, here''s fear, here''s disappointment.'),
    ('564e1775-3376-5717-9baf-e123ca06cd7f', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 173, 962477, 964377, 'I don''t want to feel these.'),
    ('a8f01b58-66da-5653-b6b9-89dd09cbad6d', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 174, 964377, 967408, 'I''m going to have a couple of beers and a banana nut muffin.'),
    ('cf9c4086-be9e-5a30-88a6-5821a623a7f2', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 175, 969993, 971886, 'I don''t want to feel these.'),
    ('ffecefc7-21fb-537f-9b16-c864c0ceeac8', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 176, 971886, 973886, 'And I know that''s knowing laughter.'),
    ('6e9da42b-f3ea-57c0-9b47-2596478b057c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 177, 973886, 976503, 'I hack into your lives for a living.'),
    ('85995ad9-6037-5edc-a771-b0350847bd0a', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 178, 980948, 986388, 'You can''t numb those hard feelings without numbing the other affects, our emotions.'),
    ('80830142-60c2-5426-ad8e-3f36d67256c2', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 179, 986388, 987864, 'You cannot selectively numb.'),
    ('135647e7-79d7-51c1-ba7e-4b67eea02504', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 180, 987864, 995827, 'So when we numb those, we numb joy, we numb gratitude, we numb happiness.'),
    ('971fea8e-9ea3-5f15-b647-6aa95beed6c0', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 181, 997098, 1003734, 'And then, we are miserable, and we are looking for purpose and meaning, and then we feel vulnerable,'),
    ('bc94de10-ac26-5e15-b9c0-c28102e6793e', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 182, 1003734, 1006566, 'so then we have a couple of beers and a banana nut muffin.'),
    ('d49e3c08-ef1f-5fd7-9c23-d537ac694342', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 183, 1006566, 1010081, 'And it becomes this dangerous cycle.'),
    ('7f8a58fb-1207-59a3-b6b1-2687af095a8a', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 184, 1011037, 1016320, 'One of the things that I think we need to think about is why and how we numb.'),
    ('dde005fd-5e0f-5129-9108-8ffde4add679', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 185, 1016878, 1019108, 'And it doesn''t just have to be addiction.'),
    ('ca3dc37c-1d00-59ba-9232-5cf5e31ee6aa', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 186, 1020427, 1023950, 'The other thing we do is we make everything that''s uncertain certain.'),
    ('aa29194c-bd95-5f2b-a3be-efe81d7970ab', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 187, 1025377, 1030487, 'Religion has gone from a belief in faith and mystery to certainty.'),
    ('82eaa4bf-e545-5af0-880a-dff971bc6e87', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 188, 1030487, 1031851, '"I''m right, you''re wrong.'),
    ('baaff318-76a5-5463-8e89-8b2b342dd3ee', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 189, 1038290, 1042139, 'The more afraid we are, the more vulnerable we are, the more afraid we are.'),
    ('f2167a03-7ef0-54a5-85ab-75cf90f3c4c6', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 190, 1042139, 1044170, 'This is what politics looks like today.'),
    ('b105a9c7-f1e8-5b60-99db-fcd236ce79ad', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 191, 1044170, 1045869, 'There''s no discourse anymore.'),
    ('a00fd331-79fe-559b-a345-31cebdaec8c0', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 192, 1045869, 1047503, 'There''s no conversation.'),
    ('ad3ee0c3-1cbe-5568-897c-9a5fddeee558', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 193, 1047757, 1049005, 'There''s just blame.'),
    ('55df7d69-41a3-540c-8832-7485b68c66e6', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 194, 1049005, 1051472, 'You know how blame is described in the research?'),
    ('5502214d-b2da-5443-bff1-d5e7bb1a026f', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 195, 1052503, 1055151, 'A way to discharge pain and discomfort.'),
    ('9a6c88f4-4c19-50bc-a7f9-ea8dec8780f2', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 196, 1058780, 1063833, 'If there''s anyone who wants their life to look like this, it would be me, but it doesn''t work.'),
    ('a9ae4493-8662-5393-90e6-fd596c9626c4', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 197, 1063833, 1067603, 'Because what we do is we take fat from our butts and put it in our cheeks.'),
    ('367748da-c022-50a1-89d3-839a374ab693', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 198, 1076924, 1080377, 'And we perfect, most dangerously, our children.'),
    ('c9d181c6-d3a5-527b-aa44-b90a57efe938', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 199, 1080377, 1082544, 'Let me tell you what we think about children.'),
    ('6a83e16e-ecdc-5c2f-9d4b-95ae670480c6', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 200, 1082544, 1085377, 'They''re hardwired for struggle when they get here.'),
    ('b60d9616-91ed-5439-ab42-515a147a866e', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 201, 1085377, 1091265, 'And when you hold those perfect little babies in your hand, our job is not to say, "Look at her, she''s perfect.'),
    ('7f525ceb-801d-56da-8750-6f3bd5494386', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 202, 1091265, 1096616, 'My job is just to keep her perfect -- make sure she makes the tennis team by fifth grade and Yale by seventh."'),
    ('6cb0fe29-4bc3-5be2-a89e-2b8130b5bf37', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 203, 1096616, 1097877, 'That''s not our job.'),
    ('34423bdf-88e2-5230-b40b-5a570b7d2ae6', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 204, 1097877, 1100252, 'Our job is to look and say, "You know what?'),
    ('259cde4b-fd32-5091-85be-44b4199ffe1b', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 205, 1100252, 1104700, 'You''re imperfect, and you''re wired for struggle, but you are worthy of love and belonging."'),
    ('05a0b3dc-cb02-5aad-8387-89aa10c15908', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 206, 1105451, 1106788, 'That''s our job.'),
    ('f0356f9f-6285-554d-86d7-50825f057870', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 207, 1107054, 1111933, 'Show me a generation of kids raised like that, and we''ll end the problems, I think, that we see today.'),
    ('2332a618-7ce3-5c53-b74c-2f3bc72c1fd3', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 208, 1111933, 1117534, 'We pretend that what we do doesn''t have an effect on people.'),
    ('71cf977e-5c0e-5605-8354-61f8cd35084d', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 209, 1118821, 1120479, 'We do that in our personal lives.'),
    ('311cbff8-0d8e-5dfb-b013-e1f3cf7c58e1', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 210, 1120479, 1123986, 'We do that corporate -- whether it''s a bailout, an oil spill...'),
    ('5281dcc4-73a5-5fc9-8518-b2700ebd6ef2', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 211, 1126520, 1130756, 'We pretend like what we''re doing doesn''t have a huge impact on other people.'),
    ('9d339a38-33c8-577b-b89d-f3e881423e54', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 212, 1131377, 1134800, 'I would say to companies, this is not our first rodeo, people.'),
    ('6a4ee506-8c4a-5e44-9d86-13942b8d470d', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 213, 1135719, 1138536, 'We just need you to be authentic and real and say...'),
    ('793eaa2f-1cdb-5eee-a80d-23a977964935', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 214, 1140904, 1142162, 'We''ll fix it."'),
    ('806ed44d-c987-51de-871a-29fad105e262', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 215, 1145485, 1148281, 'But there''s another way, and I''ll leave you with this.'),
    ('790253db-cc67-58c0-9ba1-a1cb1be31686', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 216, 1148281, 1154359, 'This is what I have found: To let ourselves be seen, deeply seen, vulnerably seen...'),
    ('07bbeed3-ff98-5736-91c0-63e14a471e0c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 217, 1156841, 1164127, 'to love with our whole hearts, even though there''s no guarantee -- and that''s really hard, and I can tell you as a parent,'),
    ('501994b0-addb-5ec6-8d98-a67343133edc', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 218, 1164127, 1174988, 'that''s excruciatingly difficult -- to practice gratitude and joy in those moments of terror, when we''re wondering, "Can I love you this much?'),
    ('27860a5c-816e-5812-8167-ad197efebdc5', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 219, 1174988, 1177198, 'Can I believe in this this passionately?'),
    ('73df81f0-88da-5981-9577-fdcdf9d8e162', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 220, 1177198, 1179152, 'Can I be this fierce about this?"'),
    ('5a7a7496-31b1-5d78-8e68-b46114814466', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 221, 1179152, 1184754, 'just to be able to stop and, instead of catastrophizing what might happen, to say, "I''m just so grateful,'),
    ('779e9738-b545-51ef-b76f-459ab552d8a7', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 222, 1184754, 1187304, 'because to feel this vulnerable means I''m alive."'),
    ('686283e2-e227-5073-9d9f-3aa07b89d23c', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 223, 1188698, 1194184, 'And the last, which I think is probably the most important, is to believe that we''re enough.'),
    ('e48a13d0-ecec-5c7c-9ee7-8688aaec773d', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 224, 1194614, 1198613, 'Because when we work from a place, I believe, that says, "I''m enough"...'),
    ('f8636ebd-414a-522d-8351-a7bcc710a2ee', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 225, 1200693, 1209335, 'then we stop screaming and start listening, we''re kinder and gentler to the people around us, and we''re kinder and gentler to ourselves.'),
    ('78a70e04-9da3-5b76-93b0-c2c6e03166fd', 'iCvmsMzlF7o', 226, 1210075, 1211161, 'That''s all I have.'),
    ('10ff9e4a-4837-531d-854d-68f53a7c30d9', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 1, 30816, 40046, 'The earliest records tell us the beans were ground and mixed with cornmeal and chili peppers to create a drink - not a relaxing cup of hot cocoa,'),
    ('f211a746-cd24-5d78-839a-cb9b88ef5825', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 2, 40046, 44686, 'but a bitter, invigorating concoction frothing with foam.'),
    ('4a77e416-e491-5d5e-ac1b-42d1c26b4b9e', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 3, 51266, 56966, 'They believed that cacao was a heavenly food gifted to humans by a feathered serpent god,'),
    ('026c7fa8-7d85-5f84-8125-f3a279955126', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 4, 56966, 62786, 'known to the Maya as Kukulkan and to the Aztecs as Quetzalcoatl.'),
    ('cf3d0bb0-8024-53f3-b63a-879ef9d0e20a', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 5, 62786, 70686, 'Aztecs used cacao beans as currency and drank chocolate at royal feasts, gave it to soldiers as a reward for success in battle,'),
    ('7d3edb13-8152-5b71-9aa4-9e33291eeb6b', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 6, 70686, 73367, 'and used it in rituals.'),
    ('a186d0a8-6cb5-5d25-b6be-479bb511e795', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 7, 91387, 102018, 'When the colonists returned with shipments of the strange new bean, missionaries'' salacious accounts of native customs gave it a reputation as an aphrodisiac.'),
    ('7cb2e676-dc44-5d10-bfdc-221184c4b10f', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 8, 102018, 110085, 'At first, its bitter taste made it suitable as a medicine for ailments, like upset stomachs, but sweetening it with honey, sugar,'),
    ('7f73d99f-d74c-5589-aad2-04e7472b7124', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 9, 110085, 115408, 'or vanilla quickly made chocolate a popular delicacy in the Spanish court.'),
    ('65aea557-21ee-51eb-a526-fc6bbd0fed2b', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 10, 126959, 134609, 'That involved using plantations and imported slave labor in the Caribbean and on islands off the coast of Africa.'),
    ('1a9db91e-f386-566d-a1bf-b464a71c75ec', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 11, 143979, 148481, 'Van Houten''s invention could separate the cocoa''s natural fat, or cocoa butter.'),
    ('cb9a4329-88aa-5980-b92d-970006f5da2a', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 12, 148481, 158159, 'This left a powder that could be mixed into a drinkable solution or recombined with the cocoa butter to create the solid chocolate we know today.'),
    ('5a1f48e0-a761-5483-9968-57e6be2026a7', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 13, 158159, 167889, 'Not long after, a Swiss chocolatier named Daniel Peter added powdered milk to the mix, thus inventing milk chocolate.'),
    ('4f4114c6-17d3-5729-aea4-c1f9e52ff2e4', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 14, 173801, 180765, 'Meeting the massive demand required more cultivation of cocoa, which can only grow near the equator.'),
    ('0d996fd9-13d8-54d9-99b0-7217a3a0a420', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 15, 180765, 186121, 'Now, instead of African slaves being shipped to South American cocoa plantations,'),
    ('87676c8b-01e4-53ae-87c8-9a604be8eb43', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 16, 194651, 200077, 'Yet along with the growth of the industry, there have been horrific abuses of human rights.'),
    ('7758de24-93c0-520c-9d3b-c0805341884f', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 17, 211892, 222851, 'This is a complex problem that persists despite efforts from major chocolate companies to partner with African nations to reduce child and indentured labor practices.'),
    ('d317db2f-6712-5e1d-a410-d72e90d5f48d', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 18, 222851, 227742, 'Today, chocolate has established itself in the rituals of our modern culture.'),
    ('111d275c-7197-5cea-9f7f-76c8ae704fa1', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 19, 227742, 239613, 'Due to its colonial association with native cultures, combined with the power of advertising, chocolate retains an aura of something sensual, decadent, and forbidden.'),
    ('2da0be11-70da-5d5a-b1c1-50cde8eff14a', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 20, 239613, 251002, 'Yet knowing more about its fascinating and often cruel history, as well as its production today, tells us where these associations originate and what they hide.'),
    ('6078f44b-35a0-5c0e-85fb-3fc5dec4f17b', 'ibjUpk9Iagk', 21, 251002, 260011, 'So as you unwrap your next bar of chocolate, take a moment to consider that not everything about chocolate is sweet.'),
    ('e12901fe-74d4-53ab-a5a1-11fbf036b386', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 1, 19179, 24240, 'In order to fund their expensive voyages, the company turned to private citizens–'),
    ('398639be-c736-5c46-bc9c-40db7b6318b7', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 2, 24240, 30550, 'individuals who could invest money to support the trip in exchange for a share of the ship''s profits.'),
    ('40f38f30-1b1a-561f-ba36-db9bf4dc68ce', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 3, 39619, 50312, 'Selling these shares in coffee houses and shipping ports across the continent, the Dutch East India Company unknowingly invented the world''s first stock market.'),
    ('fd23bf8b-4184-5e7d-93e8-470139f6c588', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 4, 78846, 82306, 'First, the company will advertise itself to big investors.'),
    ('06263df4-7f24-54e0-877f-9a3dfd51c1cb', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 5, 82306, 91186, 'If they think the company is a good idea, they get the first crack at investing, and then sponsor the company''s initial public offering, or IPO.'),
    ('e3da8cad-8c0e-5194-93fe-021a567f9e61', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 6, 91186, 99671, 'This launches the company onto the official public market, where any company or individual who believes the business could be profitable might buy a stock.'),
    ('d482b903-a446-57ce-92af-1f504241b3bc', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 7, 99671, 104231, 'Buying stocks makes those investors partial owners in the business.'),
    ('740e15af-3f04-570f-ae3e-8a4ff6105fc5', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 8, 104231, 111930, 'Their investment helps the company to grow, and as it becomes more successful, more buyers may see potential and start buying stocks.'),
    ('32338644-4f89-5fa9-97af-c959f73c902f', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 9, 111930, 117950, 'As demand for those stocks increases, so does their price, increasing the cost for prospective buyers,'),
    ('ca3c7d43-ac92-5469-b125-debf89b95cab', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 10, 117950, 121880, 'and raising the value of the company''s stocks people already own.'),
    ('1e15009f-c3db-5bf7-bea1-cd53297c7a37', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 11, 121880, 126610, 'For the company, this increased interest helps fund new initiatives,'),
    ('da5822fa-7004-5041-854d-ba3caf886b01', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 12, 126610, 133330, 'and also boosts its overall market value by showing how many people are willing to invest in their idea.'),
    ('3d2442bb-3f43-5077-84d8-6d97a4d85950', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 13, 133330, 139440, 'However, if for some reason a company starts to seem less profitable the reverse can also happen.'),
    ('6d68bae4-0972-556a-89f2-f8ad24fdcc04', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 14, 139440, 142520, 'If investors think their stock value is going to decline,'),
    ('ae8a6d5c-35a8-5796-9d4a-29b503cdc594', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 15, 142520, 147720, 'they''ll sell their stocks with the hopes of making a profit before the company loses more value.'),
    ('f4eeac5d-537c-5cb1-a1af-86afe16b9184', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 16, 147720, 154800, 'As stocks are sold and demand for the stock goes down, the stock price falls, and with it, the company''s market value.'),
    ('f352b003-03cd-5b2f-bfb0-674c0edd2606', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 17, 154800, 160790, 'This can leave investors with big losses– unless the company starts to look profitable again.'),
    ('f4f13fa6-0aa7-5ad6-83f1-0334161f5992', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 18, 160790, 165270, 'This see-saw of supply and demand is influenced by many factors.'),
    ('185aaf08-7ec2-5ac9-b373-55faf72b86c3', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 19, 165270, 175967, 'Companies are under the unavoidable influence of market forces– such as the fluctuating price of materials, changes in production technology, and the shifting costs of labor.'),
    ('6c988c65-abb0-5e60-a304-f69717b89c7b', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 20, 175967, 183317, 'Investors may be worried about changes in leadership, bad publicity, or larger factors like new laws and trade policies.'),
    ('4105558e-8670-54b5-b15c-6382d792a8cb', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 21, 183317, 189897, 'And of course, plenty of investors are simply ready to sell valuable stocks and pursue personal interests.'),
    ('52140cfb-ae7f-5633-a146-de6f172b3e1c', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 22, 189897, 196077, 'All these variables cause day-to-day noise in the market, which can make companies appear more or less successful.'),
    ('5b499815-5841-533b-87bd-c2154198c62d', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 23, 196077, 203767, 'And in the stock market, appearing to lose value often leads to losing investors, and in turn, losing actual value.'),
    ('b8b49e01-77c0-5e8c-84f8-86353cfc16c7', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 24, 203767, 210387, 'Human confidence in the market has the power to trigger everything from economic booms to financial crises.'),
    ('aed9eb50-30a3-5f11-9e6f-7238b4291bda', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 25, 210387, 218407, 'And this difficult-to-track variable is why most professionals promote reliable long term investing over trying to make quick cash.'),
    ('fa93f24f-73c3-54a8-907f-fc3b6db6abb7', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 26, 218407, 225747, 'However, experts are constantly building tools in efforts to increase their chances of success in this highly unpredictable system.'),
    ('1ef20972-3173-51ab-a968-ff9b3bcebc01', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 27, 225747, 229217, 'But the stock market is not just for the rich and powerful.'),
    ('f4ecf44f-fc3f-5ddb-b859-a00bf0268d3b', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 28, 229217, 236077, 'With the dawn of the Internet, everyday investors can buy stocks in many of the exact same ways a large investor would.'),
    ('37ec395f-d934-5c26-b1a8-703bdba9abf1', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 29, 236077, 245417, 'And as more people educate themselves about this complex system they too can trade stocks, support the businesses they believe in, and pursue their financial goals.'),
    ('0a76d4ce-2656-5607-9855-9d3620e3817e', 'p7HKvqRI_Bo', 30, 245417, 248787, 'The first step is getting invested.'),
    ('e1e3f82f-7ee4-5065-8153-228eec266502', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 1, 23214, 30122, 'Knowing how competent we are and how are skill stack up against other people''s is more than a self-esteem boost.'),
    ('a6074466-1e00-5d2c-9958-d7d1de6af87f', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 2, 30122, 39343, 'It helps us figure out when we can forge ahead on our own decisions and instincts and when we need, instead, to seek out advice.'),
    ('02c606a1-d92e-5dce-b01c-f7fbce9a6f12', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 3, 62415, 68084, 'We judge ourselves as better than others to a degree that violates the laws of math.'),
    ('13caed43-7717-5c14-807d-26bd609f9ca4', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 4, 68084, 72765, 'When software engineers at two companies were asked to rate their performance,'),
    ('c26edfb3-17e8-5934-b0d1-86b426471cb5', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 5, 89415, 91556, 'These aren''t isolated findings.'),
    ('9c1e2fcc-4046-537c-852f-02885aa9566e', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 6, 91556, 102045, 'On average, people tend to rate themselves better than most in disciplines ranging from health, leadership skills, ethics, and beyond.'),
    ('3875625e-219b-50d6-bd72-c2c506f7c76b', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 7, 102045, 110586, 'What''s particularly interesting is that those with the least ability are often the most likely to overrate their skills to the greatest extent.'),
    ('eea9bece-d48a-561b-a3e3-c6c986cd5159', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 8, 110586, 119307, 'People measurably poor at logical reasoning, grammar, financial knowledge, math, emotional intelligence, running medical lab tests,'),
    ('92efcbff-35dc-5f84-8504-f2e440b08b76', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 9, 119307, 128188, 'and chess all tend to rate their expertise almost as favorably as actual experts do.'),
    ('aaaa58e4-ac63-51e7-9485-bcd56332c6bc', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 10, 128188, 131347, 'So who''s most vulnerable to this delusion?'),
    ('4e47cd00-5ec4-514e-99a4-85edfc970c90', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 11, 131347, 138738, 'Sadly, all of us because we all have pockets of incompetence we don''t recognize.'),
    ('9ec05972-3e82-5eb7-b791-eb04d61659bd', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 12, 151279, 155098, 'First, they make mistakes and reach poor decisions.'),
    ('ba8e1ded-252b-5eb3-9c6b-3178f852bef2', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 13, 155098, 160531, 'But second, those same knowledge gaps also prevent them from catching their errors.'),
    ('22be59d6-3fba-5092-8576-ca4784ce8354', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 14, 160531, 167369, 'In other words, poor performers lack the very expertise needed to recognize how badly they''re doing.'),
    ('02c8d6e5-2e47-52c0-8ae8-8e3efa59280b', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 15, 167369, 172079, 'For example, when the researchers studied participants in a college debate tournament,'),
    ('652123d5-9ae6-5cad-b816-e3f9c05dd6a9', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 16, 183179, 192441, 'WIthout a strong grasp of the rules of debate, the students simply couldn''t recognize when or how often their arguments broke down.'),
    ('570d50c0-595e-58c7-8b3a-e9e6579fed99', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 17, 192441, 197390, 'The Dunning-Kruger effect isn''t a question of ego blinding us to our weaknesses.'),
    ('753aba13-b122-5f67-bdc5-36a05f3c5b19', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 18, 197390, 201491, 'People usually do admit their deficits once they can spot them.'),
    ('fa51e6a7-bc5f-5dfb-ae4f-c7174cbc401f', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 19, 202337, 214031, 'students who had initially done badly on a logic quiz and then took a mini course on logic were quite willing to label their original performances as awful.'),
    ('abe82127-16e6-551d-a380-fb752165c337', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 20, 214031, 221241, 'That may be why people with a moderate amount of experience or expertise often have less confidence in their abilities.'),
    ('4422e3b8-0000-5abc-891d-67cbc60a33bb', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 21, 221241, 224641, 'They know enough to know that there''s a lot they don''t know.'),
    ('48b2c803-5f53-5d8f-9f77-4fd22328d934', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 22, 224641, 229191, 'Meanwhile, experts tend to be aware of just how knowledgeable they are.'),
    ('3b89c451-cb20-5972-9f99-5e5ac1105fed', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 23, 229191, 236382, 'But they often make a different mistake: they assume that everyone else is knowledgeable, too.'),
    ('3e8dc812-7668-5ac1-8e6f-b84b8177310d', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 24, 236382, 244302, 'The result is that people, whether they''re inept or highly skilled, are often caught in a bubble of inaccurate self-perception.'),
    ('0a6dd628-1d31-58b6-8839-264385ac2e1c', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 25, 244302, 247623, 'When they''re unskilled, they can''t see their own faults.'),
    ('22cf68b9-e816-5b1d-989f-3d62d89e7960', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 26, 247623, 254253, 'When they''re exceptionally competent, they don''t perceive how unusual their abilities are.'),
    ('e2cdaf62-a3f0-5995-932f-14d1fb3de12b', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 27, 254253, 264823, 'So if the Dunning-Kruger effect is invisible to those experiencing it, what can you do to find out how good you actually are at various things?'),
    ('dc5be6ea-fc46-535c-90f9-6ce0be1a9483', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 28, 264823, 270534, 'First, ask for feedback from other people, and consider it, even if it''s hard to hear.'),
    ('1574f08d-6a32-5c25-b22f-670c4bb7a39c', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 29, 270534, 273185, 'Second, and more important, keep learning.'),
    ('500118ca-f2dc-52e0-86a0-70daef958446', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 30, 273185, 280404, 'The more knowledgeable we become, the less likely we are to have invisible holes in our competence.'),
    ('c601674f-35c7-5d19-b582-98370f7bff16', 'pOLmD_WVY-E', 31, 280404, 289215, 'Perhaps it all boils down to that old proverb: When arguing with a fool, first make sure the other person isn''t doing the same thing.'),
    ('7ab5c09f-56ca-57e6-9280-061d4e8b53b3', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 1, 49855, 58910, 'The signs that this immune response is working are the coughing, sneezing, inflammation and fever we experience, which work to trap,'),
    ('797ac09b-8af2-510b-906d-f799000669ad', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 2, 58910, 63364, 'deter and rid the body of threatening things, like bacteria.'),
    ('8b062317-4dda-5310-8497-749e23d63c38', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 3, 63364, 70148, 'These innate immune responses also trigger our second line of defense, called adaptive immunity.'),
    ('af7052ba-0f42-51b0-911a-638281c84144', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 4, 70148, 78281, 'Special cells called B cells and T cells are recruited to fight microbes, and also record information about them,'),
    ('7c89548c-288b-5e89-a92c-a248cb73ca7a', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 5, 78281, 83997, 'creating a memory of what the invaders look like, and how best to fight them.'),
    ('dff6facb-4af4-5f56-b9b9-98c15dbcc86f', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 6, 93620, 98707, 'The body takes time to learn how to respond to pathogens and to build up these defenses.'),
    ('acbd4c49-a201-5c03-8e49-5cd7ef4839a8', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 7, 98707, 103139, 'And even then, if a body is too weak or young to fight back when it''s invaded,'),
    ('2870a8b1-2fa6-5a9c-b118-8e1bb452119a', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 8, 103139, 108831, 'it might face very serious risk if the pathogen is particularly severe.'),
    ('54cd792c-5ab2-5ea4-8a58-0e2421cd0cad', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 9, 108831, 115030, 'But what if we could prepare the body''s immune response, readying it before someone even got ill?'),
    ('4c8b9387-e75f-5c67-ab00-140860e4da46', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 10, 117591, 125925, 'Using the same principles that the body uses to defend itself, scientists use vaccines to trigger the body''s adaptive immune system,'),
    ('016d5fb9-f2d2-51f7-8fc6-ec8cffb466bb', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 11, 125925, 129631, 'without exposing humans to the full strength disease.'),
    ('1691f2c4-64f8-5700-a2e8-58e76ab8705c', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 12, 129631, 136017, 'This has resulted in many vaccines, which each work uniquely, separated into many different types.'),
    ('47887a43-1d32-5099-ac70-089d2bfba97a', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 13, 136017, 139719, 'First, we have live attenuated vaccines.'),
    ('bc5d30a0-268f-532e-9d2a-dfeaadda6131', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 14, 139719, 144698, 'These are made of the pathogen itself but a much weaker and tamer version.'),
    ('a14d0222-0253-5f9c-b27a-f3e056481e95', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 15, 144698, 149449, 'Next, we have inactive vaccines, in which the pathogens have been killed.'),
    ('9e45aa7d-b6ef-5676-b0cc-dfa98711a955', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 16, 149449, 156388, 'The weakening and inactivation in both types of vaccine ensures that pathogens don''t develop into the full blown disease.'),
    ('9940fa49-e770-54c0-9248-96616dab3bf7', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 17, 156388, 166198, 'But just like a disease, they trigger an immune response, teaching the body to recognize an attack by making a profile of pathogens in preparation.'),
    ('32ab647a-79bb-590b-98d0-4993afe0fc6c', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 18, 166198, 173199, 'The downside is that live attenuated vaccines can be difficult to make, and because they''re live and quite powerful,'),
    ('2a01b8c5-a5f9-576c-b59c-aa2a05aa3363', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 19, 173199, 180913, 'people with weaker immune systems can''t have them, while inactive vaccines don''t create long-lasting immunity.'),
    ('1672b0df-87e4-5558-adda-1cf0efab4c6c', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 20, 180913, 191519, 'Another type, the subunit vaccine, is only made from one part of the pathogen, called an antigen, the ingredient that actually triggers the immune response.'),
    ('3bf240ad-baa6-5981-9e9f-29dad98c00e1', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 21, 191519, 201703, 'By even further isolating specific components of antigens, like proteins or polysaccharides, these vaccines can prompt specific responses.'),
    ('c10cf7bd-149a-5c96-bdf9-f4b7f2fe2761', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 22, 201703, 207121, 'Scientists are now building a whole new range of vaccines called DNA vaccines.'),
    ('a5cd3629-7fe3-5793-b75b-69e3319c8bb4', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 23, 207121, 216516, 'For this variety, they isolate the very genes that make the specific antigens the body needs to trigger its immune response to specific pathogens.'),
    ('7cb2f97f-1f77-54e6-9b35-d194760209e8', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 24, 216516, 222488, 'When injected into the human body, those genes instruct cells in the body to make the antigens.'),
    ('8ed03cec-caf9-5b78-90f5-7a5db3d6b4d6', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 25, 222488, 231332, 'This causes a stronger immune response, and prepares the body for any future threats, and because the vaccine only includes specific genetic material,'),
    ('5065b604-3ac3-5029-aa92-0f7b9de437b3', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 26, 231332, 238555, 'it doesn''t contain any other ingredients from the rest of the pathogen that could develop into the disease and harm the patient.'),
    ('0b3c5f1b-04b0-5455-866a-229d68c8d002', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 27, 238555, 246102, 'If these vaccines become a success, we might be able to build more effective treatments for invasive pathogens in years to come.'),
    ('b27fefec-df20-5d59-96ae-7cdeb1f1562d', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 28, 246102, 251606, 'Just like Edward Jenner''s amazing discovery spurred on modern medicine all those decades ago,'),
    ('7eda17f8-7154-56c8-9700-f7af6dfa72b6', 'rb7TVW77ZCs', 29, 251606, 259708, 'continuing the development of vaccines might even allow us to treat diseases like HIV, malaria, or Ebola, one day.'),
    ('32a30cdd-b0d4-53be-b427-5520046a908d', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 1, 350, 4643, 'Hello everyone, my name is Emma.'),
    ('abc6d9bd-26d2-5f90-9ec7-03e38a19fb62', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 2, 4643, 10627, 'Today I will tell you about my daily routine.'),
    ('b50826cb-e5f6-5197-af20-00812d1e24e6', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 3, 10627, 18286, 'I will speak slowly and clearly so you can understand me easily.'),
    ('4f99a53f-8577-58c2-91fc-6cc91494d321', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 4, 18286, 24598, 'You will learn useful words and phrases for daily life.'),
    ('58be5056-a522-5aa5-9193-fd1227985614', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 5, 24598, 33037, 'This video is a good way to practice your English listening and speaking.'),
    ('36e71c8e-6720-50b1-90b4-d391f1c75509', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 6, 33037, 35132, 'Are you ready?'),
    ('b47aa0eb-a6e2-5c32-be09-c4a48171007b', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 7, 79453, 83676, 'I look in the mirror and smile.'),
    ('c19ff74e-166e-585d-8c6a-edf7eb9d2f99', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 8, 83676, 89534, 'Sometimes I take a shower if I have time.'),
    ('f94abf1f-173b-5676-803e-e79142bd07cf', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 9, 89534, 94286, 'After that, I go to the kitchen.'),
    ('ab7ae24b-7f98-5570-a654-5d23b481aca1', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 10, 94286, 97310, 'I make my breakfast.'),
    ('7bdb81a4-b17c-595e-970d-6e4b9723f119', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 11, 97310, 103412, 'I usually eat toast with butter and eggs.'),
    ('a7f8be99-6853-5090-8fc3-2638fb11b0e3', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 12, 103412, 108269, 'Sometimes I eat cereal or fruit.'),
    ('cea9ff7f-3cb9-5e71-881e-5c36b9d3df2a', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 13, 108269, 113127, 'I always drink a hot cup of tea.'),
    ('c1c6e054-0855-5bbe-9110-97b1a8e67879', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 14, 113127, 117664, 'I like green tea in the morning.'),
    ('1395ed06-a2bb-5ee3-99a7-588e1f5b3133', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 15, 117664, 123386, 'It helps me feel calm and ready for the day.'),
    ('d58c2acf-b334-5ac9-a387-63f063dd92f0', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 16, 123386, 129677, 'While I eat, I listen to music or check my phone.'),
    ('19fe2938-b730-5dd4-a6fa-3792334fe673', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 17, 129677, 136070, 'I like to read messages or the weather for the day.'),
    ('63ecb7cd-e385-5767-9d4c-ab57af8e3086', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 18, 136070, 140990, 'After breakfast, I go back to my room.'),
    ('55190728-f241-5635-a2b7-5ead9ffb4296', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 19, 140990, 144056, 'I choose what to wear.'),
    ('eb94f993-f2ec-52eb-8870-b47b985193ff', 'reKgQh0E9kg', 20, 144056, 149523, 'I usually wear jeans and a simple shirt.'),
